window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":20,"en":"Business, Marketing & Innovation","zh":"商業、行銷與創新","items":[{"w":"business plan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a written plan of how a new business will work and make money","cn":"營運計畫書","s":"Before the bank agreed to lend her any money, it asked to see a detailed ______ ______, so she spent two weeks writing it.","zh":"在銀行同意借她任何錢之前，它要求看一份詳細的營運計畫書，所以她花了兩週撰寫。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A1","t":"營運計畫書","a":["business","plan"]},{"w":"sole trader","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who owns and runs a business alone","cn":"獨資經營者","s":"My uncle works as a ______ ______ selling handmade furniture, so he keeps all the profit but also carries all the risk.","zh":"我叔叔以獨資經營者的身分販售手工家具，所以他保有全部利潤，但也承擔所有風險。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A2","t":"獨資經營者","a":["sole","trader"]},{"w":"franchise","pos":"n.","def":"the right to sell a company's products under its name","cn":"加盟經營權","s":"She bought a coffee shop ______ from a famous chain, and the company trained her staff before the shop opened.","zh":"她向一家知名連鎖店買下咖啡店的加盟經營權，而且該公司在開店前培訓了她的員工。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A3","t":"加盟經營權","a":["franchise"]},{"w":"franchisee","pos":"n.","def":"a person who runs a shop under a franchise","cn":"加盟主","s":"Every ______ must follow the same recipes and rules, but each one can choose how to decorate the shop.","zh":"每一位加盟主都必須遵守相同的食譜與規定，但每個人可以自行決定如何裝潢店面。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A4","t":"加盟主","a":["franchisee"]},{"w":"headquarters","pos":"n.","def":"the main office of a large company","cn":"總部","s":"The company's ______ is in Taipei, but most of its factories are in other countries where land is cheaper.","zh":"這家公司的總部位於台北，但它大部分的工廠都在土地較便宜的其他國家。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A5","t":"總部","a":["headquarters"]},{"w":"branch office","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a smaller office of a company in another place","cn":"分公司","s":"The bank opened a new ______ ______ near our school, so my parents no longer have to drive downtown.","zh":"這家銀行在我們學校附近開了一間新的分公司，所以我爸媽不必再開車到市中心了。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A6","t":"分公司","a":["branch","office"]},{"w":"founder","pos":"n.","def":"the person who starts a company","cn":"創辦人","s":"The ______ of the company started the business in her garage, and now it employs more than five hundred people.","zh":"這家公司的創辦人在她的車庫裡開始這門生意，而現在公司雇用了超過五百人。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A7","t":"創辦人","a":["founder"]},{"w":"co-founder","pos":"n.","def":"one of two or more people who start a company together","cn":"共同創辦人","s":"He became a ______ of the app with his best friend from university, and they still share the same office.","zh":"他和大學時最好的朋友一起成為這個應用程式的共同創辦人，而且他們至今仍共用同一間辦公室。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A8","t":"共同創辦人","a":["co-founder"]},{"w":"chief executive","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the person with the highest position in a company","cn":"執行長","s":"The ______ ______ announced the new plan at the meeting, and the share price rose the next morning.","zh":"執行長在會議上宣布了新計畫，而隔天早上股價就上漲了。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A9","t":"執行長","a":["chief","executive"]},{"w":"board of directors","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the group of people who control a company","cn":"董事會","s":"The ______ ______ ______ voted against the risky project, so the manager had to find a cheaper idea.","zh":"董事會投票反對這個高風險的計畫，所以經理必須另找一個比較便宜的點子。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A10","t":"董事會","a":["board","of","directors"]},{"w":"chairperson","pos":"n.","def":"the person who leads a meeting or a board","cn":"主席","s":"As ______ of the meeting, Ms Lin made sure everyone had a chance to speak, but she kept each person to two minutes.","zh":"身為會議的主席，林女士確保每個人都有發言的機會，但她將每個人限制在兩分鐘內。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A11","t":"主席","a":["chairperson"]},{"w":"managing director","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the person in charge of running a company each day","cn":"總經理","s":"The ______ ______ visits every department once a month because she wants to hear workers' ideas directly.","zh":"總經理每個月走訪每個部門一次，因為她想直接聽取員工的想法。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A12","t":"總經理","a":["managing","director"]},{"w":"firm","pos":"n.","def":"a company, especially a small or professional one","cn":"公司；事務所","s":"My cousin works for a small law ______ in Kaohsiung, and she often stays late when there is an important case.","zh":"我表姐在高雄一家小型法律事務所工作，而且遇到重要案件時她常常加班到很晚。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A13","t":"事務所","a":["firm"]},{"w":"corporation","pos":"n.","def":"a large company or group of companies","cn":"大型企業","s":"The huge ______ owns hotels, airlines and supermarkets, so it can offer customers discounts across all of them.","zh":"這家龐大的大型企業擁有飯店、航空公司和超市，所以能在所有這些事業中提供顧客折扣。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A14","t":"大型企業","a":["corporation"]},{"w":"limited company","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a company whose owners only lose what they invested if it fails","cn":"有限公司","s":"They turned their family shop into a ______ ______, so their own house would be safe if the business failed.","zh":"他們把家族商店改成有限公司，這樣即使生意失敗，他們自己的房子也會安全。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A15","t":"有限公司","a":["limited","company"]},{"w":"business model","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way a company plans to make money","cn":"商業模式","s":"The free app shows adverts to users, and this ______ ______ has made the company very rich.","zh":"這個免費應用程式會向使用者顯示廣告，而這種商業模式讓公司賺了大錢。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A16","t":"商業模式","a":["business","model"]},{"w":"mission statement","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a short sentence about a company's main aims","cn":"使命宣言","s":"The ______ ______ on the wall says the company wants to make healthy food cheap, but some workers doubt it.","zh":"牆上的使命宣言寫著公司希望讓健康食品變便宜，但有些員工對此存疑。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A17","t":"使命宣言","a":["mission","statement"]},{"w":"premises","pos":"n.","def":"the building and land a business uses","cn":"營業場所","s":"Smoking is not allowed anywhere on the ______, so the staff have to walk to the park during their break.","zh":"營業場所內任何地方都禁止吸菸，所以員工休息時必須走到公園去。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A18","t":"營業場所","a":["premises"]},{"w":"operating costs","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the money needed to run a business every day","cn":"營運成本","s":"Electricity and rent make up most of the restaurant's ______ ______, so the owner switched to energy-saving lights.","zh":"電費和租金占了這家餐廳大部分的營運成本，所以老闆改用節能燈具。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A19","t":"營運成本","a":["operating","costs"]},{"w":"bankrupt","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to pay one's debts","cn":"破產的","s":"The bookshop went ______ last year because fewer people bought paper books, and the building is now a café.","zh":"這家書店去年破產了，因為買紙本書的人變少，而那棟建築現在成了咖啡店。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A20","t":"破產","a":["bankrupt"]},{"w":"bankruptcy","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being unable to pay debts","cn":"破產","s":"The airline was close to ______ during the pandemic, but the government lent it money to keep flying.","zh":"這家航空公司在疫情期間幾乎破產，但政府借錢給它讓它能繼續飛行。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A21","t":"破產","a":["bankruptcy"]},{"w":"liquidation","pos":"n.","def":"closing a company and selling everything to pay debts","cn":"清算","s":"After the company went into ______, all its computers and desks were sold, and the workers lost their jobs.","zh":"這家公司進入清算後，所有電腦和桌子都被賣掉，員工們也失去了工作。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A22","t":"清算","a":["liquidation"]},{"w":"takeover","pos":"n.","def":"when one company gets control of another","cn":"收購","s":"The small game studio agreed to the ______ because the bigger company promised to keep all its designers.","zh":"這家小型遊戲工作室同意了這項收購，因為那家較大的公司承諾留下所有設計師。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A23","t":"收購","a":["takeover"]},{"w":"merger","pos":"n.","def":"when two companies join to become one","cn":"合併","s":"The ______ of the two banks created the largest bank in the country, but some branches had to close.","zh":"兩家銀行的合併創造了國內最大的銀行，但有些分行不得不關閉。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A24","t":"合併","a":["merger"]},{"w":"joint venture","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a business project run by two companies together","cn":"合資企業","s":"The Taiwanese firm and a Japanese carmaker started a ______ ______ to build electric scooters, and both share the profits.","zh":"這家台灣公司與一家日本汽車製造商成立了一家合資企業來生產電動機車，而且雙方共享利潤。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A25","t":"合資企業","a":["joint","venture"]},{"w":"SME","pos":"n.","def":"a small or medium-sized business","cn":"中小企業","s":"Most companies in Taiwan are small, and a typical ______ has fewer than two hundred workers, so such firms matter to the economy.","zh":"台灣大多數公司規模都很小，一家典型的中小企業員工少於兩百人，因此這類公司對經濟很重要。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A26","t":"中小企業","a":["SME"]},{"w":"family-run","pos":"adj.","def":"owned and managed by one family","cn":"家族經營的","s":"We always eat at a small ______ noodle shop near the station because the grandmother still cooks the soup herself.","zh":"我們總是在車站附近一家小小的家族經營的麵店吃飯，因為奶奶仍然親自熬湯。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A27","t":"家族經營的","a":["family-run"]},{"w":"self-employed","pos":"adj.","def":"working for yourself, not for a company","cn":"自雇的","s":"Since becoming ______, my aunt can choose her own hours, but she has to find all her customers by herself.","zh":"自從成為自雇者後，我阿姨可以自己選擇工作時間，但她必須自己找所有的客戶。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A28","t":"自雇者","a":["self-employed"]},{"w":"business owner","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who owns a company or shop","cn":"企業主；老闆","s":"As a ______ ______, Mr Chen worries about rent every month, yet he loves being his own boss.","zh":"身為企業主，陳先生每個月都擔心房租，但他很喜歡自己當老闆。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A29","t":"企業主","a":["business","owner"]},{"w":"spin-off","pos":"n.","def":"a new company created from part of an older one","cn":"分拆出來的公司","s":"The video team became a ______ of the TV channel, and it now makes its own shows for streaming sites.","zh":"影片團隊成為電視頻道分拆出來的公司，而現在它為串流網站製作自己的節目。","part":"A","sec":"Starting & Running a Business 創業與公司經營","lab":"A30","t":"分拆出來的公司","a":["spin-off"]},{"w":"accountant","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is to keep or check money records","cn":"會計師","s":"Our ______ checks the shop's records every month, and she told us we were spending too much on packaging.","zh":"我們的會計師每個月檢查店裡的帳目，而且她告訴我們包裝花費太多了。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A31","t":"會計師","a":["accountant"]},{"w":"accounting","pos":"n.","def":"the job of keeping and checking money records","cn":"會計","s":"She studied ______ at university because she is good with numbers, and now she works for a big bank.","zh":"她在大學主修會計，因為她擅長數字，而現在她在一家大銀行工作。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A32","t":"會計","a":["accounting"]},{"w":"bookkeeping","pos":"n.","def":"recording the money a business receives and spends","cn":"記帳","s":"Simple ______ software helps small shop owners record every sale, so they know exactly how much money they have.","zh":"簡單的記帳軟體幫助小店主記錄每一筆銷售，所以他們清楚知道自己有多少錢。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A33","t":"記帳","a":["bookkeeping"]},{"w":"balance sheet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a report showing what a company owns and owes","cn":"資產負債表","s":"The ______ ______ showed that the company owed more than it owned, so the investors became very worried.","zh":"資產負債表顯示這家公司負債多於資產，所以投資人變得非常擔心。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A34","t":"資產負債表","a":["balance","sheet"]},{"w":"cash flow","pos":"n.phr.","def":"money moving into and out of a business","cn":"現金流","s":"The shop sells a lot in December, but its ______ ______ is weak in summer, so the owner saves money in advance.","zh":"這家店在十二月賣得很多，但夏天的現金流很弱，所以老闆會預先存錢。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A35","t":"現金流","a":["cash","flow"]},{"w":"down payment","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the first part of the price paid when buying something big","cn":"頭期款","s":"My parents saved for ten years to make a ______ ______ on a flat, and they will pay the rest over twenty years.","zh":"我爸媽存了十年的錢來支付一間公寓的頭期款，而剩下的款項他們會在二十年內付清。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A36","t":"頭期款","a":["down","payment"]},{"w":"interest rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the percentage paid for borrowing money","cn":"利率","s":"When the bank raised its ______ ______, many families paid more for their homes, so they cut down on eating out.","zh":"當銀行調高利率時，許多家庭的房貸支出變多，所以他們減少外食。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A37","t":"利率","a":["interest","rate"]},{"w":"debt","pos":"n.","def":"money that you owe to someone","cn":"債務","s":"He used three credit cards at the same time, and soon he was in serious ______ that took years to pay back.","zh":"他同時使用三張信用卡，很快他就陷入了花好幾年才還清的嚴重債務中。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A38","t":"債務","a":["debt"]},{"w":"credit card","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a plastic card used to buy things and pay later","cn":"信用卡","s":"Paying with a ______ ______ is convenient, but you should pay the full bill each month or the bank charges extra.","zh":"用信用卡付款很方便，但你應該每個月付清全額帳單，否則銀行會額外收費。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A39","t":"信用卡","a":["credit","card"]},{"w":"invoice","pos":"n.","def":"a document asking a customer to pay for goods or work","cn":"請款單；發票","s":"The designer sent the client an ______ after finishing the logo, but she still had not been paid two months later.","zh":"設計師完成標誌後寄給客戶一張請款單，但兩個月後她仍然沒有收到款項。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A40","t":"請款單","a":["invoice"]},{"w":"receipt","pos":"n.","def":"a paper showing that you have paid for something","cn":"收據","s":"Please keep your ______ in case the shoes do not fit, because the shop will not return your money without it.","zh":"請保留你的收據以防鞋子不合腳，因為沒有收據店家不會退款。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A41","t":"收據","a":["receipt"]},{"w":"tax return","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a form you send to the government about your income","cn":"報稅單","s":"Every May my father fills in his ______ ______ online, and he is always happy when he gets some money back.","zh":"每年五月我爸爸都在網路上填寫他的報稅單，而且他拿到退稅時總是很開心。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A42","t":"報稅單","a":["tax","return"]},{"w":"auditor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who officially checks a company's accounts","cn":"稽核員；審計師","s":"The ______ found several mistakes in the company's records, so the managers had to explain where the money went.","zh":"稽核員在公司的紀錄中發現了好幾個錯誤，所以經理們必須解釋錢的去向。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A43","t":"稽核員","a":["auditor"]},{"w":"net profit","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the money left after all costs are paid","cn":"淨利","s":"The café sold a lot of drinks this year, but its ______ ______ was small because rent and wages were so high.","zh":"這家咖啡店今年賣出很多飲料，但它的淨利很少，因為租金和薪資太高了。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A44","t":"淨利","a":["net","profit"]},{"w":"earnings","pos":"n.","def":"money that a person or company earns","cn":"收入；盈餘","s":"The company's ______ rose by ten percent this year, so every worker received a small extra payment.","zh":"這家公司今年的盈餘成長了百分之十，所以每位員工都得到一筆小額的額外款項。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A45","t":"盈餘","a":["earnings"]},{"w":"financial year","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the twelve months a company uses for its accounts","cn":"會計年度","s":"At the end of the ______ ______, the team counts every sale, and then the boss decides next year's budget.","zh":"在會計年度結束時，團隊會統計每一筆銷售，然後老闆決定明年的預算。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A46","t":"會計年度","a":["financial","year"]},{"w":"quarter","pos":"n.","def":"a period of three months in a business year","cn":"季度","s":"Sales were poor in the first ______, but they improved after the summer campaign, so the year ended well.","zh":"第一季度的銷售很差，但在夏季活動後有所改善，所以這一年結束得很好。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A47","t":"季度","a":["quarter"]},{"w":"stock market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the place where shares in companies are bought and sold","cn":"股票市場","s":"My grandfather has put money into the ______ ______ for thirty years, but he never buys shares he does not understand.","zh":"我爺爺把錢投入股票市場已經三十年了，但他從不買自己不了解的股票。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A48","t":"股票市場","a":["stock","market"]},{"w":"share price","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the cost of one share in a company","cn":"股價","s":"The ______ ______ fell sharply after the phone caught fire, and investors lost a lot of money that week.","zh":"在那款手機起火後股價大跌，投資人那週損失了很多錢。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A49","t":"股價","a":["share","price"]},{"w":"stock exchange","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an organisation where company shares are traded","cn":"證券交易所","s":"The company joined the ______ ______ last year, so now anyone can buy a small part of it.","zh":"這家公司去年在證券交易所上市，所以現在任何人都可以買下它的一小部分。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A50","t":"證券交易所","a":["stock","exchange"]},{"w":"stockbroker","pos":"n.","def":"a person who buys and sells shares for other people","cn":"股票經紀人","s":"Instead of paying a ______, many young people now use apps to buy shares, but some lose money quickly.","zh":"許多年輕人現在不付錢給股票經紀人，而是用應用程式買股票，但有些人很快就賠錢。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A51","t":"股票經紀人","a":["stockbroker"]},{"w":"crowdfunding","pos":"n.","def":"raising money from many people, usually online","cn":"群眾募資","s":"The students used ______ to pay for their robot, and more than three hundred strangers gave small amounts online.","zh":"學生們利用群眾募資來支付機器人的費用，而且有超過三百位陌生人在網路上捐了小額款項。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A52","t":"群眾募資","a":["crowdfunding"]},{"w":"venture capital","pos":"n.phr.","def":"money invested in new companies with high risk","cn":"創業投資","s":"The start-up received ______ ______ from a big fund, so it could hire twenty engineers in one year.","zh":"這家新創公司獲得了一筆大型基金的創業投資，所以一年內就能雇用二十名工程師。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A53","t":"創業投資","a":["venture","capital"]},{"w":"angel investor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a rich person who gives money to a new business early","cn":"天使投資人","s":"An ______ ______ gave them their first million dollars, and she also helped them find good staff.","zh":"一位天使投資人給了他們第一筆一百萬美元，而且她也幫助他們找到好員工。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A54","t":"天使投資人","a":["angel","investor"]},{"w":"overdraft","pos":"n.","def":"money you take out of a bank beyond what is in your account","cn":"透支","s":"The shop used its ______ to pay suppliers in a bad month, but the bank charged high fees for it.","zh":"這家店在生意差的月份用透支付款給供應商，但銀行為此收取高額費用。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A55","t":"透支","a":["overdraft"]},{"w":"cryptocurrency","pos":"n.","def":"digital money that is not controlled by a bank","cn":"加密貨幣","s":"Some shops now accept ______ as payment, but its value changes so fast that many owners still prefer cash.","zh":"有些商店現在接受用加密貨幣付款，但它的價值變化太快，所以許多店主仍偏好現金。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A56","t":"加密貨幣","a":["cryptocurrency"]},{"w":"lender","pos":"n.","def":"a person or bank that lends money","cn":"放款人；貸方","s":"The ______ refused to give him more money because he had not paid back his last loan on time.","zh":"放款人拒絕再借他錢，因為他沒有準時還清上一筆貸款。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A57","t":"放款人","a":["lender"]},{"w":"repay","pos":"v.","def":"to pay back money you borrowed","cn":"償還","s":"She promised to ______ the money within a year, and she worked weekends at a café so she could keep her promise.","zh":"她承諾在一年內償還這筆錢，而且她週末在咖啡店打工以便信守承諾。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A58","t":"償還","a":["repay"]},{"w":"expense","pos":"n.","def":"money spent on something","cn":"費用；開支","s":"Travel is the biggest ______ for our sales team, so the company now holds more meetings online.","zh":"交通是我們業務團隊最大的開支，所以公司現在更多會議改在線上舉行。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A59","t":"開支","a":["expense"]},{"w":"fundraising","pos":"n.","def":"collecting money for a cause or project","cn":"募款","s":"The school's ______ event raised enough money for a new library, and parents baked cakes to sell.","zh":"學校的募款活動籌到足夠的錢蓋新圖書館，而且家長們烤了蛋糕來義賣。","part":"A","sec":"Money, Finance & Accounting 金錢、財務與會計","lab":"A60","t":"募款","a":["fundraising"]},{"w":"marketer","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is to make people want a product","cn":"行銷人員","s":"A good ______ studies what young people watch online, and then she plans adverts that appear in the right places.","zh":"一位好的行銷人員會研究年輕人在網路上看什麼，然後規劃出現在正確位置的廣告。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A61","t":"行銷人員","a":["marketer"]},{"w":"market research","pos":"n.phr.","def":"collecting information about what customers want","cn":"市場調查","s":"Before launching the drink, the company did ______ ______ in five cities, and it found that people wanted less sugar.","zh":"在推出這款飲料前，公司在五個城市做了市場調查，而且發現人們想要少一點糖。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A62","t":"市場調查","a":["market","research"]},{"w":"target market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the group of people a product is made for","cn":"目標市場","s":"The ______ ______ for this game is teenagers, so the adverts appear on video sites rather than in newspapers.","zh":"這款遊戲的目標市場是青少年，所以廣告出現在影音網站上而不是報紙上。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A63","t":"目標市場","a":["target","market"]},{"w":"customer base","pos":"n.phr.","def":"all the regular customers of a business","cn":"顧客群","s":"The bakery has a loyal ______ ______ in the neighbourhood, but it wants to attract tourists as well.","zh":"這家麵包店在社區裡有忠實的顧客群，但它也想吸引觀光客。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A64","t":"顧客群","a":["customer","base"]},{"w":"branding","pos":"n.","def":"creating a special image and name for a product","cn":"品牌塑造","s":"Clever ______ made the cheap water bottle look stylish, so teenagers were happy to pay more for it.","zh":"聰明的品牌塑造讓這個便宜的水壺看起來很時尚，所以青少年樂意花更多錢買它。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A65","t":"品牌塑造","a":["branding"]},{"w":"brand loyalty","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when customers keep buying the same brand","cn":"品牌忠誠度","s":"Many phone users show strong ______ ______, so they buy the same brand again even when others are cheaper.","zh":"許多手機使用者表現出強烈的品牌忠誠度，所以即使其他品牌更便宜，他們還是會再買同一個牌子。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A66","t":"品牌忠誠度","a":["brand","loyalty"]},{"w":"brand awareness","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how many people know about a brand","cn":"品牌知名度","s":"The company sponsored a popular marathon to increase ______ ______, and its logo appeared on every runner's shirt.","zh":"這家公司贊助一場熱門馬拉松來提高品牌知名度，而且它的標誌出現在每位跑者的上衣上。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A67","t":"品牌知名度","a":["brand","awareness"]},{"w":"brand image","pos":"n.phr.","def":"what people think and feel about a brand","cn":"品牌形象","s":"The scandal damaged the company's ______ ______, so it spent millions on adverts about protecting nature.","zh":"這起醜聞損害了公司的品牌形象，所以它花了數百萬在保護自然的廣告上。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A68","t":"品牌形象","a":["brand","image"]},{"w":"advert","pos":"n.","def":"a picture, film or text that tries to sell something","cn":"廣告","s":"I skipped the ______ before the video, but I still remembered the song because it was so catchy.","zh":"我跳過了影片前的廣告，但我還是記得那首歌，因為它太好記了。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A69","t":"廣告","a":["advert"]},{"w":"promotion","pos":"n.","def":"activities to make people buy a product","cn":"促銷","s":"The supermarket is running a ______ this week, so if you buy two bottles of shampoo, you get one free.","zh":"超市這週正在舉辦促銷活動，所以如果你買兩瓶洗髮精，就送你一瓶。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A70","t":"促銷","a":["promotion"]},{"w":"promotional","pos":"adj.","def":"made to advertise a product","cn":"宣傳的","s":"The band handed out free ______ T-shirts at the concert, and fans wore them on social media for weeks.","zh":"樂團在演唱會上發送免費的宣傳T恤，而歌迷們好幾週都穿著它們出現在社群媒體上。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A71","t":"宣傳","a":["promotional"]},{"w":"price cut","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a reduction in the price of something","cn":"降價","s":"The phone company announced a big ______ ______ after sales fell, and long queues formed outside its shops.","zh":"手機公司在銷量下滑後宣布大幅降價，而它的門市外排起了長長的隊伍。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A72","t":"降價","a":["price","cut"]},{"w":"coupon","pos":"n.","def":"a piece of paper or code that lets you pay less","cn":"優惠券","s":"My mother always uses a ______ when she orders pizza online, so we usually get a free drink as well.","zh":"我媽媽在網路上訂披薩時總是使用優惠券，所以我們通常還會得到一杯免費飲料。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A73","t":"優惠券","a":["coupon"]},{"w":"free sample","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small amount of a product given away to try","cn":"免費試用品","s":"The shop gave out a ______ ______ of the new cookies, and many people bought a whole box after tasting one.","zh":"那家店發送新餅乾的免費試用品，而許多人嘗過之後就買了一整盒。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A74","t":"免費試用品","a":["free","sample"]},{"w":"ad campaign","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a planned series of adverts for one product","cn":"廣告活動","s":"The ______ ______ for the new sports shoes used famous athletes, but it was criticised for being too expensive.","zh":"新款運動鞋的廣告活動請來知名運動員，但它因花費過高而受到批評。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A75","t":"廣告活動","a":["ad","campaign"]},{"w":"celebrity endorsement","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when a famous person says they use and like a product","cn":"名人代言","s":"The skin cream sold out quickly after a ______ ______ by a popular singer, although experts doubted it worked.","zh":"在一位當紅歌手的名人代言後，這款乳霜很快就賣光了，儘管專家懷疑它是否有效。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A76","t":"名人代言","a":["celebrity","endorsement"]},{"w":"viral marketing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"marketing that spreads fast as people share it online","cn":"病毒式行銷","s":"The funny video was a clever piece of ______ ______, because millions of people shared it without knowing it was an advert.","zh":"這支好笑的影片是一個聰明的病毒式行銷，因為數百萬人在不知道它是廣告的情況下分享了它。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A77","t":"病毒式行銷","a":["viral","marketing"]},{"w":"influencer marketing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"paying popular online people to show a product","cn":"網紅行銷","s":"Many beauty brands spend more on ______ ______ than on TV adverts, because young people trust online stars more.","zh":"許多美妝品牌在網紅行銷上的花費比電視廣告還多，因為年輕人更信任網路明星。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A78","t":"網紅行銷","a":["influencer","marketing"]},{"w":"email marketing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"sending adverts and offers to customers by email","cn":"電子郵件行銷","s":"The shop uses ______ ______ to tell customers about sales, but too many messages can make people unsubscribe.","zh":"這家店用電子郵件行銷告訴顧客特價訊息，但太多訊息可能會讓人們取消訂閱。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A79","t":"電子郵件行銷","a":["email","marketing"]},{"w":"SEO","pos":"n.","def":"making a website appear higher in search results","cn":"搜尋引擎最佳化","s":"The small hotel improved its ______, so now it appears near the top when tourists search for rooms in Tainan.","zh":"這家小飯店改善了它的搜尋引擎最佳化，所以現在遊客搜尋台南的房間時它會出現在前面。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A80","t":"搜尋引擎最佳化","a":["SEO"]},{"w":"click-through rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the percentage of people who click on an online advert","cn":"點擊率","s":"The ______ ______ for the new banner was very low, so the designers changed the colours and the words.","zh":"新橫幅廣告的點擊率非常低，所以設計師更改了顏色和文字。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A81","t":"點擊率","a":["click-through","rate"]},{"w":"market segment","pos":"n.phr.","def":"one group of customers with similar needs","cn":"市場區隔","s":"Electric bikes for older people are a growing ______ ______, so several companies are designing lighter models.","zh":"給年長者的電動自行車是一個成長中的市場區隔，所以好幾家公司正在設計更輕的車款。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A82","t":"市場區隔","a":["market","segment"]},{"w":"positioning","pos":"n.","def":"how a company wants customers to see its product compared to others","cn":"市場定位","s":"The brand's ______ as a luxury product means it never offers discounts, even when sales are slow.","zh":"這個品牌作為奢侈品的市場定位意味著它從不打折，即使銷售緩慢也一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A83","t":"市場定位","a":["positioning"]},{"w":"unique selling point","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the special feature that makes a product different","cn":"獨特賣點","s":"The phone's ______ ______ ______ is its long battery life, so the adverts show people using it on a three-day trip.","zh":"這款手機的獨特賣點是電池續航力長，所以廣告呈現人們在三天旅行中使用它的情景。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A84","t":"獨特賣點","a":["unique","selling","point"]},{"w":"focus group","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small group asked to give opinions on a product","cn":"焦點團體","s":"The company showed the new snack to a ______ ______ of teenagers, and most of them said it was too salty.","zh":"公司把新零食拿給一群青少年組成的焦點團體看，而他們大多數說太鹹了。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A85","t":"焦點團體","a":["focus","group"]},{"w":"questionnaire","pos":"n.","def":"a list of written questions to collect opinions","cn":"問卷","s":"Customers who fill in the short ______ get a free coffee, so many people are happy to give their opinions.","zh":"填寫簡短問卷的顧客可以得到一杯免費咖啡，所以許多人樂意提供意見。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A86","t":"問卷","a":["questionnaire"]},{"w":"consumer behaviour","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way people choose and buy things","cn":"消費者行為","s":"Studies of ______ ______ show that people buy more when music is slow, so many shops play calm songs.","zh":"消費者行為的研究顯示，音樂緩慢時人們會買得更多，所以許多商店播放輕柔的歌曲。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A87","t":"消費者行為","a":["consumer","behaviour"]},{"w":"marketing mix","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the combination of product, price, place and promotion","cn":"行銷組合","s":"The class learned that the ______ ______ includes price and place, and then each group planned one for a new drink.","zh":"全班學到行銷組合包含價格與通路，然後每一組為一款新飲料做了規劃。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A88","t":"行銷組合","a":["marketing","mix"]},{"w":"loyalty card","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a card that gives regular customers rewards","cn":"集點卡；會員卡","s":"I have a ______ ______ for the bubble tea shop, and after ten drinks I get one for free.","zh":"我有那家珍奶店的集點卡，而且集滿十杯後我可以免費得到一杯。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A89","t":"集點卡","a":["loyalty","card"]},{"w":"sponsorship","pos":"n.","def":"money a company gives to an event in return for advertising","cn":"贊助","s":"The bank's ______ of the school football team paid for new uniforms, and its name is printed on every shirt.","zh":"銀行對校足球隊的贊助支付了新球衣的費用，而它的名字印在每件球衣上。","part":"A","sec":"Marketing & Advertising 行銷與廣告","lab":"A90","t":"贊助","a":["sponsorship"]},{"w":"customer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who buys goods or services","cn":"顧客","s":"The shop owner greets every ______ by name, so people feel welcome and keep coming back.","zh":"店主會叫出每位顧客的名字打招呼，所以人們覺得受歡迎並且一再回來。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A91","t":"顧客","a":["customer"]},{"w":"client","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that pays for professional services","cn":"客戶","s":"The designer met her ______ in a café to show the first drawings, and he asked for a few small changes.","zh":"設計師在咖啡店與她的客戶見面展示初稿，而他要求做幾處小修改。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A92","t":"客戶","a":["client"]},{"w":"customer service","pos":"n.phr.","def":"help that a company gives to its customers","cn":"客戶服務","s":"The airline's ______ ______ was so slow that I waited forty minutes on the phone, but the staff were finally very kind.","zh":"這家航空公司的客戶服務太慢了，我在電話上等了四十分鐘，但工作人員最後非常親切。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A93","t":"客戶服務","a":["customer","service"]},{"w":"salesperson","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is selling things","cn":"銷售員","s":"The ______ explained every feature of the laptop patiently, so my father decided to buy it that afternoon.","zh":"銷售員耐心解說筆電的每項功能，所以我爸爸那天下午就決定買了。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A94","t":"銷售員","a":["salesperson"]},{"w":"sales target","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the amount a seller is expected to sell","cn":"銷售目標","s":"Our team reached its ______ ______ two weeks early, so the manager took everyone out for dinner.","zh":"我們團隊提早兩週達成銷售目標，所以經理請大家出去吃晚餐。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A95","t":"銷售目標","a":["sales","target"]},{"w":"shop assistant","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who serves customers in a shop","cn":"店員","s":"The ______ ______ helped me find a smaller size, and she even checked the other branch when it was sold out.","zh":"店員幫我找了小一號的尺寸，而且在賣完時她甚至幫我查了另一家分店。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A96","t":"店員","a":["shop","assistant"]},{"w":"checkout","pos":"n.","def":"the place in a shop where you pay","cn":"結帳櫃檯","s":"There was a long queue at the ______, so I used the self-service machine and left the store quickly.","zh":"結帳櫃檯排了很長的隊，所以我用了自助結帳機並很快離開商店。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A97","t":"結帳櫃檯","a":["checkout"]},{"w":"refund","pos":"n.","def":"money returned to a customer","cn":"退款","s":"The headphones stopped working after two days, so I took them back and asked for a full ______.","zh":"耳機用了兩天就壞了，所以我拿回去要求全額退款。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A98","t":"退款","a":["refund"]},{"w":"return policy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a shop's rules about taking back goods","cn":"退貨政策","s":"The store has a generous ______ ______, so you can bring clothes back within thirty days if you keep the label.","zh":"這家店有寬鬆的退貨政策，所以只要保留標籤，你可以在三十天內退回衣服。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A99","t":"退貨政策","a":["return","policy"]},{"w":"warranty","pos":"n.","def":"a written promise to repair a product if it breaks","cn":"保固","s":"The washing machine has a two-year ______, so the company repaired it for free when it started leaking.","zh":"這台洗衣機有兩年保固，所以它開始漏水時公司免費修好了。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A100","t":"保固","a":["warranty"]},{"w":"after-sales service","pos":"n.phr.","def":"help a company gives after you buy something","cn":"售後服務","s":"Good ______ ______ is important for expensive products, because customers want help if something goes wrong.","zh":"良好的售後服務對昂貴產品很重要，因為顧客希望出問題時能得到協助。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A101","t":"售後服務","a":["after-sales","service"]},{"w":"complaint","pos":"n.","def":"a statement that something is wrong or unfair","cn":"投訴；抱怨","s":"The hotel received a ______ about noise from the bar, so the manager closed it earlier on weeknights.","zh":"飯店接到關於酒吧噪音的投訴，所以經理讓它在平日提早打烊。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A102","t":"投訴","a":["complaint"]},{"w":"online review","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an opinion about a product or place posted on the internet","cn":"網路評論","s":"One bad ______ ______ can scare away customers, so many restaurants reply politely to every comment.","zh":"一則負面的網路評論就可能嚇跑顧客，所以許多餐廳會禮貌回覆每一則留言。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A103","t":"網路評論","a":["online","review"]},{"w":"bargain","pos":"n.","def":"something bought for less than its usual price","cn":"便宜貨；划算的東西","s":"The jacket was a real ______ at half price, and I have worn it almost every day this winter.","zh":"這件夾克半價買真是划算，而且我這個冬天幾乎每天都穿它。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A104","t":"划算","a":["bargain"]},{"w":"haggle","pos":"v.","def":"to argue about the price of something","cn":"討價還價","s":"Tourists often ______ with the sellers at the night market, but some stalls have fixed prices on signs.","zh":"遊客常在夜市和攤販討價還價，但有些攤位在招牌上標有固定價格。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A105","t":"討價還價","a":["haggle"]},{"w":"price list","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a list showing the prices of goods or services","cn":"價目表","s":"The hair salon put its ______ ______ on the window, so customers know the cost before they walk in.","zh":"這家髮廊把價目表貼在窗戶上，所以顧客進門前就知道價格。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A106","t":"價目表","a":["price","list"]},{"w":"retail price","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the price a shop charges customers","cn":"零售價","s":"The ______ ______ of the game is two thousand dollars, but online stores often sell it for less.","zh":"這款遊戲的零售價是兩千元，但網路商店常常賣得更便宜。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A107","t":"零售價","a":["retail","price"]},{"w":"markup","pos":"n.","def":"the amount added to the cost to make a profit","cn":"加價；利潤加成","s":"Restaurants put a large ______ on drinks, so a bottle of water can cost three times more than in a shop.","zh":"餐廳對飲料有很高的加價，所以一瓶水可能比商店貴三倍。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A108","t":"加價","a":["markup"]},{"w":"clearance sale","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sale to get rid of old stock cheaply","cn":"清倉拍賣","s":"The furniture shop is closing down, so it is holding a ______ ______ with everything at seventy percent off.","zh":"這家家具店即將歇業，所以正在舉辦全面三折的清倉拍賣。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A109","t":"清倉拍賣","a":["clearance","sale"]},{"w":"shopping mall","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large building with many shops","cn":"購物中心","s":"On rainy weekends, families crowd into the ______ ______ because it has cinemas, restaurants and air-conditioning.","zh":"在下雨的週末，家庭們擠進購物中心，因為那裡有電影院、餐廳和冷氣。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A110","t":"購物中心","a":["shopping","mall"]},{"w":"online shopping","pos":"n.phr.","def":"buying things on the internet","cn":"網路購物","s":"______ ______ saves time, but my grandmother still prefers the market because she likes to touch the vegetables.","zh":"網路購物節省時間，但我奶奶仍偏好市場，因為她喜歡摸摸蔬菜。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A111","t":"網路購物","a":["Online","shopping"]},{"w":"shopping cart","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a list of items you plan to buy on a website","cn":"購物車","s":"I left three books in my online ______ ______ for a week, and then the shop sent me a discount code.","zh":"我把三本書放在網路購物車裡一個星期，然後商店寄給我一組折扣碼。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A112","t":"購物車","a":["shopping","cart"]},{"w":"free shipping","pos":"n.phr.","def":"delivery without any charge","cn":"免運費","s":"The website offers ______ ______ on orders over one thousand dollars, so I added a few more items to my order.","zh":"這個網站訂單滿一千元就免運費，所以我在訂單裡多加了幾樣東西。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A113","t":"免運費","a":["free","shipping"]},{"w":"out of stock","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"not available because all have been sold","cn":"缺貨的","s":"The new console was ______ ______ ______ in every shop, so my brother had to wait three months for one.","zh":"新款遊戲主機在每家店都缺貨，所以我哥哥必須等三個月才買到。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A114","t":"缺貨","a":["out","of","stock"]},{"w":"showroom","pos":"n.","def":"a room where goods like cars are shown to buyers","cn":"展示間","s":"We visited the car ______ to test-drive an electric car, but the salesperson could not answer all our questions.","zh":"我們去汽車展示間試駕電動車，但銷售員無法回答我們所有的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A115","t":"展示間","a":["showroom"]},{"w":"window shopping","pos":"n.phr.","def":"looking at goods in shops without buying","cn":"逛街看櫥窗","s":"We had no money left, so we just went ______ ______ along the street and dreamed about the shoes.","zh":"我們沒錢了，所以只是沿著街逛街看櫥窗，夢想著那些鞋子。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A116","t":"逛街看櫥窗","a":["window","shopping"]},{"w":"impulse buying","pos":"n.phr.","def":"buying things suddenly without planning","cn":"衝動購物","s":"Shops put sweets next to the checkout to encourage ______ ______, and children often beg their parents for them.","zh":"商店把糖果放在結帳櫃檯旁來鼓勵衝動購物，而小孩常會向父母討著要。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A117","t":"衝動購物","a":["impulse","buying"]},{"w":"upsell","pos":"v.","def":"to persuade a customer to buy a more expensive item","cn":"追加銷售","s":"The waiter tried to ______ us a large meal with dessert, but we only wanted a light lunch.","zh":"服務生試圖向我們追加銷售含甜點的大份餐點，但我們只想吃頓簡單的午餐。","part":"A","sec":"Sales, Customers & Retail 銷售、顧客與零售","lab":"A118","t":"追加銷售","a":["upsell"]},{"w":"employee","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is paid to work for a company","cn":"員工","s":"Every new ______ gets a laptop on the first day, and a senior worker shows them around the office.","zh":"每位新員工第一天都會拿到一台筆電，而且一位資深員工會帶他們參觀辦公室。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A119","t":"員工","a":["employee"]},{"w":"staff","pos":"n.","def":"all the people who work for an organisation","cn":"員工；全體職員","s":"The restaurant is short of ______ during the holidays, so the owner's children help in the kitchen.","zh":"這家餐廳在假期期間人手不足，所以老闆的孩子會到廚房幫忙。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A120","t":"人手","a":["staff"]},{"w":"manager","pos":"n.","def":"a person who controls a team or part of a business","cn":"經理","s":"The ______ listened to our ideas carefully, but she said we had to finish the project before Friday.","zh":"經理仔細聽取我們的想法，但她說我們必須在週五前完成專案。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A121","t":"經理","a":["manager"]},{"w":"management","pos":"n.","def":"the people who control a company","cn":"管理階層","s":"The ______ decided to close the factory, so hundreds of workers protested outside the head office.","zh":"管理階層決定關閉工廠，所以數百名工人在總公司外抗議。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A122","t":"管理階層","a":["management"]},{"w":"team leader","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who guides a small group of workers","cn":"組長","s":"As ______ ______, Ken gives each person a clear task, and he checks their progress every afternoon.","zh":"身為組長，阿肯給每個人明確的任務，而且他每天下午檢查他們的進度。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A123","t":"組長","a":["team","leader"]},{"w":"boss","pos":"n.","def":"the person who is in charge of you at work","cn":"老闆；上司","s":"My ______ lets me work from home on Fridays because I always finish my reports on time.","zh":"我的上司讓我週五在家工作，因為我總是準時完成報告。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A124","t":"上司","a":["boss"]},{"w":"department","pos":"n.","def":"a section of a large organisation","cn":"部門","s":"She moved from the sales ______ to marketing last year, and she enjoys planning adverts much more.","zh":"她去年從銷售部門調到行銷部，而且她更喜歡規劃廣告。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A125","t":"部門","a":["department"]},{"w":"human resources","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the department that deals with hiring and staff","cn":"人力資源部","s":"If you have a problem with your contract, you should talk to ______ ______, because they handle staff issues.","zh":"如果你的合約有問題，你應該找人力資源部談，因為他們負責處理員工事務。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A126","t":"人力資源部","a":["human","resources"]},{"w":"job interview","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a meeting where an employer asks questions to choose a worker","cn":"工作面試","s":"I felt nervous before my first ______ ______, but I had practised my answers, so it went well.","zh":"我在第一次工作面試前很緊張，但我練習過答案，所以進行得很順利。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A127","t":"工作面試","a":["job","interview"]},{"w":"job description","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a written list of the duties of a job","cn":"職務說明","s":"According to the ______ ______, the assistant must speak English, so my sister decided to apply.","zh":"根據職務說明，這位助理必須會說英文，所以我姊姊決定去應徵。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A128","t":"職務說明","a":["job","description"]},{"w":"pay rise","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an increase in the money you earn","cn":"加薪","s":"After three years without a ______ ______, the nurses asked the hospital for more money, and it finally agreed.","zh":"在三年沒有加薪之後，護理師們向醫院要求加薪，而醫院最終同意了。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A129","t":"加薪","a":["pay","rise"]},{"w":"bonus","pos":"n.","def":"extra money added to normal pay","cn":"獎金","s":"Workers in Taiwan usually get a year-end ______ before Lunar New Year, so they can buy gifts for their families.","zh":"台灣的員工通常在農曆新年前拿到年終獎金，所以他們可以為家人買禮物。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A130","t":"獎金","a":["bonus"]},{"w":"benefits package","pos":"n.phr.","def":"all the extra things a job offers, like insurance and holidays","cn":"福利方案","s":"The salary was lower than I hoped, but the ______ ______ included free meals and extra holidays.","zh":"薪水比我期望的低，但福利方案包括免費餐點和額外假期。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A131","t":"福利方案","a":["benefits","package"]},{"w":"performance review","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a meeting to discuss how well someone works","cn":"績效評估","s":"In her ______ ______, the manager praised her teamwork, but she said Amy should speak up more in meetings.","zh":"在她的績效評估中，經理稱讚她的團隊合作，但說艾美應該在會議中多發言。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A132","t":"績效評估","a":["performance","review"]},{"w":"resign","pos":"v.","def":"to leave your job officially","cn":"辭職","s":"He decided to ______ from the bank because he wanted to open his own café, and his boss wished him luck.","zh":"他決定從銀行辭職，因為他想開自己的咖啡店，而他的老闆祝他好運。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A133","t":"辭職","a":["resign"]},{"w":"resignation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of leaving a job","cn":"辭職；辭呈","s":"The coach handed in his ______ after the team lost ten games in a row, so the club began looking for a new one.","zh":"在球隊連輸十場後，教練遞出了辭呈，所以球隊開始尋找新教練。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A134","t":"辭呈","a":["resignation"]},{"w":"fire","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone leave their job","cn":"開除；解雇","s":"The company had to ______ the worker who stole money, and it also changed the way cash is counted.","zh":"公司必須開除那名偷錢的員工，而且也改變了點算現金的方式。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A135","t":"開除","a":["fire"]},{"w":"recruitment","pos":"n.","def":"the process of finding new workers","cn":"招募","s":"______ is hard for factories in the countryside, because many young people prefer to work in big cities.","zh":"鄉間工廠的招募很困難，因為許多年輕人比較喜歡在大城市工作。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A136","t":"招募","a":["Recruitment"]},{"w":"onboarding","pos":"n.","def":"helping new workers learn about their job and company","cn":"新人到職訓練","s":"The company's ______ lasts two weeks, so new staff learn the systems before they meet any customers.","zh":"公司的新人到職訓練為期兩週，所以新員工在接觸任何客戶前會先學習系統。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A137","t":"新人到職訓練","a":["onboarding"]},{"w":"teamwork","pos":"n.","def":"working well together as a group","cn":"團隊合作","s":"The project succeeded because of good ______, and each member helped the others when they fell behind.","zh":"這個專案因為良好的團隊合作而成功，而且每位成員在別人進度落後時都會幫忙。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A138","t":"團隊合作","a":["teamwork"]},{"w":"minutes","pos":"n.","def":"a written record of what was said at a meeting","cn":"會議紀錄","s":"Linda wrote the ______ of the meeting, so anyone who was absent could read what had been decided.","zh":"琳達撰寫了會議的會議紀錄，所以任何缺席的人都能讀到決議內容。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A139","t":"會議紀錄","a":["minutes"]},{"w":"delegation","pos":"n.","def":"giving part of your work to someone else","cn":"授權；分派工作","s":"Good ______ helps busy managers, because they can focus on big decisions while their team handles daily tasks.","zh":"良好的授權能幫助忙碌的經理，因為他們可以專注於重大決策，而團隊處理日常事務。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A140","t":"授權","a":["delegation"]},{"w":"work-life balance","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a healthy mix of time for work and personal life","cn":"工作與生活的平衡","s":"Many young workers care about ______ ______, so they choose jobs that let them leave at six o'clock.","zh":"許多年輕員工重視工作與生活的平衡，所以他們選擇可以六點下班的工作。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A141","t":"工作與生活的平衡","a":["work-life","balance"]},{"w":"flexitime","pos":"n.","def":"a system where workers choose when to start and finish","cn":"彈性工時","s":"With ______, my mother starts work at seven, so she can pick up my brother from school at four.","zh":"有了彈性工時，我媽媽七點開始上班，所以她可以四點去學校接我弟弟。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A142","t":"彈性工時","a":["flexitime"]},{"w":"chain of command","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the order of power from the top to the bottom of a group","cn":"指揮體系","s":"In a large company, a ______ ______ ______ is clear, but it can make decisions very slow.","zh":"在大公司裡，指揮體系很清楚，但它可能讓決策變得非常緩慢。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A143","t":"指揮體系","a":["chain","of","command"]},{"w":"middle manager","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a manager between top leaders and ordinary workers","cn":"中階主管","s":"As a ______ ______, Mr Wu must follow orders from above, yet he also has to keep his own team happy.","zh":"身為中階主管，吳先生必須服從上級命令，但他也得讓自己的團隊開心。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A144","t":"中階主管","a":["middle","manager"]},{"w":"trainee","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is learning a job","cn":"實習生；受訓者","s":"The ______ chef watched the head cook closely, and after six months she could make the soup on her own.","zh":"那位實習廚師仔細觀察主廚，而且六個月後她就能獨自做湯了。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A145","t":"實習","a":["trainee"]},{"w":"office politics","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the ways people try to gain power at work","cn":"辦公室政治","s":"He was good at his job, but he hated ______ ______, so he left to work for himself.","zh":"他很擅長自己的工作，但他討厭辦公室政治，所以他離職自己創業。","part":"A","sec":"The Workplace & Management 職場與管理","lab":"A146","t":"辦公室政治","a":["office","politics"]},{"w":"research and development","pos":"n.phr.","def":"work to create new products and improve old ones","cn":"研發","s":"The company spends a fifth of its income on ______ ______ ______, so it releases new phones every year.","zh":"這家公司把五分之一的收入花在研發上，所以它每年都推出新手機。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A147","t":"研發","a":["research","and","development"]},{"w":"disruptive","pos":"adj.","def":"changing an industry by doing things in a new way","cn":"顛覆性的","s":"Streaming was a ______ idea for the film industry, and many video rental shops closed within a few years.","zh":"串流對電影產業是一個顛覆性的想法，而許多錄影帶出租店在幾年內就關門了。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A148","t":"顛覆性的","a":["disruptive"]},{"w":"incubator","pos":"n.","def":"an organisation that helps new companies grow","cn":"育成中心","s":"The university runs an ______ for student businesses, so young founders get free offices and advice.","zh":"大學經營一個學生創業的育成中心，所以年輕創辦人能得到免費辦公室和建議。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A149","t":"育成中心","a":["incubator"]},{"w":"accelerator","pos":"n.","def":"a short programme that helps start-ups grow very fast","cn":"加速器","s":"After joining a three-month ______ in Singapore, the team improved its app and met many investors.","zh":"在加入新加坡一個為期三個月的加速器計畫後，團隊改進了他們的應用程式並結識許多投資人。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A150","t":"加速器","a":["accelerator"]},{"w":"unicorn","pos":"n.","def":"a young company worth over one billion dollars","cn":"獨角獸企業","s":"The delivery app became a ______ in only four years, but it has never made a profit.","zh":"這個外送應用程式只花了四年就成為獨角獸企業，但它從來沒有獲利過。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A151","t":"獨角獸企業","a":["unicorn"]},{"w":"sales pitch","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a talk that tries to persuade someone to buy","cn":"推銷話術","s":"His ______ ______ was short and funny, so the investors listened carefully and asked for a second meeting.","zh":"他的推銷話術簡短又有趣，所以投資人仔細聆聽並要求第二次會面。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A152","t":"推銷話術","a":["sales","pitch"]},{"w":"pitch deck","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a set of slides used to present a business idea","cn":"募資簡報","s":"The founders spent all night on their ______ ______, because they had only ten minutes to impress the judges.","zh":"創辦人整晚都在準備他們的募資簡報，因為他們只有十分鐘來打動評審。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A153","t":"募資簡報","a":["pitch","deck"]},{"w":"seed funding","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the first money a new company gets to start","cn":"種子資金","s":"With the ______ ______, they built a simple version of the app, and then they asked users for feedback.","zh":"他們用種子資金開發了一個簡單版本的應用程式，然後向使用者徵求回饋。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A154","t":"種子資金","a":["seed","funding"]},{"w":"scale-up","pos":"n.","def":"a young company that is growing very quickly","cn":"規模化成長企業","s":"The firm is no longer a tiny start-up but a ______, so it is opening offices in three new countries.","zh":"這家公司已不再是小小的新創，而是一家規模化成長企業，所以它正在三個新國家開設辦公室。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A155","t":"規模化成長企業","a":["scale-up"]},{"w":"minimum viable product","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the simplest version of a product that people can test","cn":"最小可行產品","s":"Instead of waiting a year, the team launched a ______ ______ ______ in a month and improved it with users' ideas.","zh":"團隊沒有等上一年，而是在一個月內推出最小可行產品，再根據使用者的想法改進。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A156","t":"最小可行產品","a":["minimum","viable","product"]},{"w":"iterate","pos":"v.","def":"to repeat a process to improve something step by step","cn":"反覆改進","s":"Designers ______ quickly by testing small changes every week, and they keep only the ones users like.","zh":"設計師每週測試小改動來快速反覆改進，而且只保留使用者喜歡的部分。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A157","t":"反覆改進","a":["iterate"]},{"w":"iteration","pos":"n.","def":"one version in a series of improvements","cn":"版本；迭代","s":"The first ______ of the robot kept falling over, but the fifth version could walk up stairs.","zh":"這個機器人的第一個版本一直跌倒，但第五個版本已經能走上樓梯。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A158","t":"版本","a":["iteration"]},{"w":"pivot","pos":"v.","def":"to change a business plan in a new direction","cn":"轉型","s":"The start-up sold cameras at first, but it decided to ______ to software when sales were poor.","zh":"這家新創起初賣相機，但在銷售不佳時決定轉型做軟體。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A159","t":"轉型","a":["pivot"]},{"w":"beta","pos":"n.","def":"an early version of software tested by users","cn":"測試版","s":"I joined the ______ of the new game, so I could play it early and report any bugs to the makers.","zh":"我加入了新遊戲的測試版，所以我能提早玩並向開發者回報任何錯誤。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A160","t":"測試版","a":["beta"]},{"w":"product development","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the process of creating a new product","cn":"產品開發","s":"______ ______ took three years because the engineers wanted the battery to be completely safe.","zh":"產品開發花了三年，因為工程師希望電池完全安全。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A161","t":"產品開發","a":["Product","development"]},{"w":"user experience","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how easy and pleasant something is to use","cn":"使用者體驗","s":"The bank improved the ______ ______ of its app, so older customers can now pay bills without asking for help.","zh":"銀行改善了應用程式的使用者體驗，所以年長顧客現在不用求助就能繳費。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A162","t":"使用者體驗","a":["user","experience"]},{"w":"early-stage","pos":"adj.","def":"at the beginning of development","cn":"早期階段的","s":"Investing in ______ companies is risky, because many of them close before they make any money.","zh":"投資早期階段的公司風險很高，因為許多公司在賺到錢之前就關門了。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A163","t":"早期階段的","a":["early-stage"]},{"w":"entrepreneurship","pos":"n.","def":"the skills and activity of starting businesses","cn":"創業精神；創業","s":"The school offers a course in ______, and students must design and sell a real product by the end of term.","zh":"學校開設一門創業課程，而學生必須在學期末前設計並銷售一個真正的產品。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A164","t":"創業","a":["entrepreneurship"]},{"w":"entrepreneurial","pos":"adj.","def":"willing to take risks to start new businesses","cn":"有創業精神的","s":"My cousin is very ______, so she started selling phone cases online when she was only fifteen.","zh":"我表妹很有創業精神，所以她才十五歲就開始在網路上賣手機殼。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A165","t":"有創業精神","a":["entrepreneurial"]},{"w":"tech giant","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a very large and powerful technology company","cn":"科技巨頭","s":"The small app was bought by a ______ ______, and its founders became rich overnight.","zh":"這個小應用程式被一家科技巨頭收購，而它的創辦人一夜致富。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A166","t":"科技巨頭","a":["tech","giant"]},{"w":"Silicon Valley","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area in California famous for tech companies","cn":"矽谷","s":"Many engineers dream of working in ______ ______, but the high rent there makes life expensive.","zh":"許多工程師夢想在矽谷工作，但那裡的高房租讓生活很昂貴。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A167","t":"矽谷","a":["Silicon","Valley"]},{"w":"hackathon","pos":"n.","def":"an event where people build software together very fast","cn":"黑客松；程式馬拉松","s":"Our team stayed awake for two days at the ______, and we built an app that helps students share notes.","zh":"我們團隊在黑客松熬了兩天，而且我們做出了一個幫助學生分享筆記的應用程式。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A168","t":"黑客松","a":["hackathon"]},{"w":"crowdsourcing","pos":"n.","def":"getting ideas or work from a large group of people online","cn":"群眾外包","s":"The museum used ______ to name its new dinosaur, and thousands of children sent in suggestions.","zh":"博物館利用群眾外包為新的恐龍命名，而數千名孩子寄來了建議。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A169","t":"群眾外包","a":["crowdsourcing"]},{"w":"copycat","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that copies another's idea","cn":"模仿者","s":"Soon after the cafe became popular, a ______ opened across the street with the same menu and lower prices.","zh":"那家咖啡店爆紅不久，對街就開了一家菜單相同、價格更低的模仿者。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A170","t":"模仿者","a":["copycat"]},{"w":"first-mover advantage","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the benefit of being the first company in a new market","cn":"先行者優勢","s":"The company had a ______ ______ in electric scooters, but rivals soon offered cheaper models.","zh":"這家公司在電動機車市場擁有先行者優勢，但競爭對手很快就推出更便宜的車款。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A171","t":"先行者優勢","a":["first-mover","advantage"]},{"w":"design thinking","pos":"n.phr.","def":"solving problems by focusing on users' real needs","cn":"設計思考","s":"Using ______ ______, the students interviewed elderly people first, and then they designed an easier remote control.","zh":"學生們運用設計思考，先訪問了長者，然後設計出更好用的遙控器。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A172","t":"設計思考","a":["design","thinking"]},{"w":"fintech","pos":"n.","def":"technology used to provide financial services","cn":"金融科技","s":"______ apps let people send money with their phones, so many young people rarely visit a bank.","zh":"金融科技應用程式讓人們用手機轉帳，所以許多年輕人很少去銀行。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A173","t":"金融科技","a":["Fintech"]},{"w":"sharing economy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a system where people rent or share things through apps","cn":"共享經濟","s":"Bike rental apps are part of the ______ ______, and they let people ride without owning a bike.","zh":"租借腳踏車的應用程式是共享經濟的一部分，讓人們不用擁有腳踏車也能騎車。","part":"A","sec":"Innovation & Start-up Culture 創新與新創文化","lab":"A174","t":"共享經濟","a":["sharing","economy"]},{"w":"exporter","pos":"n.","def":"a country or company that sells goods abroad","cn":"出口國；出口商","s":"Taiwan is a major ______ of computer chips, so its economy depends on demand from other countries.","zh":"台灣是電腦晶片的主要出口國，所以它的經濟依賴其他國家的需求。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A175","t":"出口國","a":["exporter"]},{"w":"importer","pos":"n.","def":"a country or company that buys goods from abroad","cn":"進口國；進口商","s":"Japan is a big ______ of food, because it does not have enough farmland to feed everyone.","zh":"日本是糧食的主要進口國，因為它沒有足夠的農地養活所有人。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A176","t":"進口國","a":["importer"]},{"w":"free trade","pos":"n.phr.","def":"trade between countries without taxes or limits","cn":"自由貿易","s":"Supporters of ______ ______ say it makes goods cheaper, but some farmers fear they cannot compete.","zh":"自由貿易的支持者說它讓商品更便宜，但有些農民擔心他們無法競爭。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A177","t":"自由貿易","a":["free","trade"]},{"w":"trade deal","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an agreement between countries about buying and selling goods","cn":"貿易協定","s":"The two countries signed a ______ ______ last month, so fruit can now be exported without extra taxes.","zh":"兩國上個月簽署了一項貿易協定，所以現在水果可以免額外關稅出口。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A178","t":"貿易協定","a":["trade","deal"]},{"w":"trade war","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when countries keep raising taxes on each other's goods","cn":"貿易戰","s":"During the ______ ______, prices of phones and toys went up, and many factories moved to other countries.","zh":"在貿易戰期間，手機和玩具的價格上漲，而且許多工廠遷往其他國家。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A179","t":"貿易戰","a":["trade","war"]},{"w":"exchange rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the value of one currency compared with another","cn":"匯率","s":"The ______ ______ was good when we visited Japan, so our hotel and meals felt cheaper than usual.","zh":"我們去日本時匯率很好，所以飯店和餐點感覺比平常便宜。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A180","t":"匯率","a":["exchange","rate"]},{"w":"multinational","pos":"n.","def":"a large company that works in many countries","cn":"跨國公司","s":"She works for a ______ with offices in twenty countries, so she often has meetings late at night.","zh":"她在一家在二十個國家設有辦公室的跨國公司工作，所以她常在深夜開會。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A181","t":"跨國公司","a":["multinational"]},{"w":"GDP","pos":"n.","def":"the total value of goods and services a country produces in a year","cn":"國內生產毛額","s":"The country's ______ grew by three percent last year, but many families said they did not feel richer.","zh":"這個國家的國內生產毛額去年成長了百分之三，但許多家庭說他們並沒有覺得更富裕。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A182","t":"國內生產毛額","a":["GDP"]},{"w":"economic growth","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an increase in the amount of goods and services produced","cn":"經濟成長","s":"Fast ______ ______ created many new jobs, but it also caused traffic and pollution in the cities.","zh":"快速的經濟成長創造了許多新工作，但它也在城市造成交通和污染問題。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A183","t":"經濟成長","a":["economic","growth"]},{"w":"economist","pos":"n.","def":"an expert who studies how money and trade work","cn":"經濟學家","s":"The ______ warned that prices would keep rising, so she advised families to save more money.","zh":"這位經濟學家警告物價會持續上漲，所以她建議家庭多存點錢。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A184","t":"經濟學家","a":["economist"]},{"w":"purchasing power","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how much you can buy with your money","cn":"購買力","s":"When prices rise faster than wages, people lose ______ ______, and they buy fewer things.","zh":"當物價漲得比薪水快時，人們就會失去購買力，而且買的東西會變少。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A185","t":"購買力","a":["purchasing","power"]},{"w":"price war","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when companies keep cutting prices to beat each other","cn":"價格戰","s":"The two bubble tea chains started a ______ ______, and customers enjoyed cheap drinks for a whole month.","zh":"兩家珍奶連鎖店展開了一場價格戰，而顧客享受了整整一個月的便宜飲料。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A186","t":"價格戰","a":["price","war"]},{"w":"free market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an economy where prices are set by buyers and sellers, not the government","cn":"自由市場","s":"In a ______ ______, prices go up when goods are scarce, but this can hurt poor families.","zh":"在自由市場中，商品稀少時價格會上漲，但這可能傷害貧困家庭。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A187","t":"自由市場","a":["free","market"]},{"w":"emerging market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a country whose economy is growing and developing fast","cn":"新興市場","s":"Vietnam is an ______ ______ with many young workers, so foreign companies are building factories there.","zh":"越南是一個擁有許多年輕勞工的新興市場，所以外國公司正在那裡蓋工廠。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A188","t":"新興市場","a":["emerging","market"]},{"w":"developing country","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a poorer country that is building up its industry","cn":"開發中國家","s":"Cheap mobile phones changed life in every ______ ______, because farmers could check prices before selling crops.","zh":"便宜的手機改變了每個開發中國家的生活，因為農民在賣作物前就能查詢價格。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A189","t":"開發中國家","a":["developing","country"]},{"w":"trade deficit","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when a country imports more than it exports","cn":"貿易逆差","s":"The country has a large ______ ______ because it buys more cars and oil than it sells abroad.","zh":"這個國家有很大的貿易逆差，因為它購買的汽車和石油比它出口的還多。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A190","t":"貿易逆差","a":["trade","deficit"]},{"w":"protectionism","pos":"n.","def":"protecting home industries by taxing foreign goods","cn":"貿易保護主義","s":"______ may save some local jobs, but it often makes goods more expensive for ordinary shoppers.","zh":"貿易保護主義可能保住一些本地工作，但它常讓一般消費者的商品變得更貴。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A191","t":"貿易保護主義","a":["Protectionism"]},{"w":"economic crisis","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a time when an economy suddenly becomes very weak","cn":"經濟危機","s":"During the ______ ______, many banks failed, and my parents worried that they would lose their savings.","zh":"在經濟危機期間，許多銀行倒閉，而我爸媽擔心他們會失去積蓄。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A192","t":"經濟危機","a":["economic","crisis"]},{"w":"market crash","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sudden, large fall in share prices","cn":"股市崩盤","s":"Many people lost money in the ______ ______, so they became afraid of buying shares for years.","zh":"許多人在股市崩盤中賠了錢，所以他們好幾年都害怕買股票。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A193","t":"股市崩盤","a":["market","crash"]},{"w":"bailout","pos":"n.","def":"money given to save a company or country from failing","cn":"紓困","s":"The government gave the airline a ______ to keep it flying, but taxpayers were angry about it.","zh":"政府給予航空公司紓困讓它繼續營運，但納稅人對此很生氣。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A194","t":"紓困","a":["bailout"]},{"w":"cartel","pos":"n.","def":"a group of companies that agree to keep prices high","cn":"卡特爾；聯合壟斷組織","s":"The oil ______ agreed to produce less oil, so petrol prices rose all over the world.","zh":"石油卡特爾同意減產，所以全世界的汽油價格都上漲了。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A195","t":"卡特爾","a":["cartel"]},{"w":"bull market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a time when share prices are rising","cn":"多頭市場","s":"In a ______ ______ almost everyone seems to make money, but wise investors still save some cash.","zh":"在多頭市場中幾乎每個人似乎都在賺錢，但明智的投資人仍會保留一些現金。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A196","t":"多頭市場","a":["bull","market"]},{"w":"bear market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a time when share prices are falling","cn":"空頭市場","s":"The ______ ______ lasted almost two years, so my uncle waited patiently before selling his shares.","zh":"那次空頭市場持續了將近兩年，所以我叔叔耐心等待才賣出他的股票。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A197","t":"空頭市場","a":["bear","market"]},{"w":"devaluation","pos":"n.","def":"a fall in the value of a country's money","cn":"貨幣貶值","s":"After the ______ of the currency, imported goods became much more expensive, but tourists found the country cheap.","zh":"在貨幣貶值後，進口商品變得貴很多，但遊客發現這個國家很便宜。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A198","t":"貶值","a":["devaluation"]},{"w":"trade route","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a path used to move goods between places","cn":"貿易路線","s":"The canal is an important ______ ______ between Asia and Europe, so a blockage there delays ships worldwide.","zh":"這條運河是亞洲和歐洲之間重要的貿易路線，所以那裡一旦堵塞就會延誤全世界的船隻。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A199","t":"貿易路線","a":["trade","route"]},{"w":"global market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"buying and selling between countries all over the world","cn":"全球市場","s":"Thanks to the internet, a small tea farm can sell to the ______ ______, and customers in Canada now buy its oolong.","zh":"多虧了網路，一座小茶園也能銷售到全球市場，而加拿大的顧客現在會買它的烏龍茶。","part":"A","sec":"Global Trade & the Economy 全球貿易與經濟","lab":"A200","t":"全球市場","a":["global","market"]},{"w":"analyst","pos":"n.","def":"a person who studies data and gives advice","cn":"分析師","s":"The ______ studied the company's sales figures carefully, and she predicted that profits would rise next year.","zh":"這位分析師仔細研究了公司的銷售數字，而且她預測明年利潤會上升。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"分析師","a":["analyst"]},{"w":"backing","pos":"n.","def":"help or support, often money","cn":"支持；資金援助","s":"With the ______ of a large bank, the young company could build a new factory, so it hired fifty workers.","zh":"有了一家大銀行的支持，這家年輕的公司得以蓋新工廠，所以雇用了五十名員工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"支持","a":["backing"]},{"w":"bargaining","pos":"n.","def":"discussing to reach an agreement about price or pay","cn":"談判；議價","s":"After weeks of ______, the union and the company agreed on a pay rise, so the workers ended their strike.","zh":"經過數週的談判，工會和公司就加薪達成協議，所以工人結束了罷工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"談判","a":["bargaining"]},{"w":"competence","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to do something well","cn":"能力；勝任","s":"The new manager showed great ______ in her first month, and the team quickly began to trust her decisions.","zh":"新經理在第一個月就展現了出色的能力，而團隊很快就開始信任她的決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"能力","a":["competence"]},{"w":"competitiveness","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to compete well with others","cn":"競爭力","s":"The factory bought new machines to improve its ______, because cheaper rivals were winning many customers.","zh":"工廠購買了新機器來提升競爭力，因為較便宜的對手正在搶走許多顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"競爭力","a":["competitiveness"]},{"w":"complacency","pos":"n.","def":"feeling too satisfied, so you stop trying hard","cn":"自滿","s":"The market leader lost customers through ______, because it stopped improving while smaller rivals kept innovating.","zh":"這家市場龍頭因為自滿而流失顧客，因為它停止進步，而較小的對手持續創新。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"自滿","a":["complacency"]},{"w":"compliant","pos":"adj.","def":"following rules or laws","cn":"符合規定的","s":"All our toys must be ______ with safety laws, so every batch is tested in a laboratory before shipping.","zh":"我們所有的玩具都必須符合安全法規，所以每一批在出貨前都會在實驗室檢測。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"符合","a":["compliant"]},{"w":"consultancy","pos":"n.","def":"a company that gives expert advice","cn":"顧問公司","s":"The hospital hired a ______ to cut waiting times, and the experts suggested a new booking system.","zh":"醫院聘請了一家顧問公司來縮短等候時間，而專家們建議採用新的預約系統。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"顧問公司","a":["consultancy"]},{"w":"consultant","pos":"n.","def":"an expert who is paid to give advice","cn":"顧問","s":"The ______ visited our shop for a week, and she told us to move the best-selling items near the door.","zh":"這位顧問來我們店裡一週，而她告訴我們把最暢銷的商品移到門口附近。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"顧問","a":["consultant"]},{"w":"contractual","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to a contract","cn":"合約上的","s":"The builder had a ______ duty to finish the office by June, so he paid a fine when it was late.","zh":"營造商有合約上的義務要在六月前完成辦公室，所以延誤時他付了罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"合約上的","a":["contractual"]},{"w":"cooperate","pos":"v.","def":"to work together for the same goal","cn":"合作","s":"The two rival shops decided to ______ during the festival, and they shared one large stall to save money.","zh":"兩家競爭的商店決定在節慶期間合作，而且他們共用一個大攤位來省錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"合作","a":["cooperate"]},{"w":"creditworthy","pos":"adj.","def":"trusted to pay back money","cn":"信用良好的","s":"The bank decided she was ______ because she always paid her bills on time, so it lent her the money quickly.","zh":"銀行認定她信用良好，因為她總是準時繳帳單，所以很快就借錢給她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"信用良好","a":["creditworthy"]},{"w":"cutback","pos":"n.","def":"a reduction in spending or staff","cn":"削減","s":"The newspaper made big ______ last year, so many reporters lost their jobs and the paper became thinner.","zh":"這家報社去年大幅削減開支，所以許多記者失業，報紙也變薄了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"削減","a":["cutbacks"]},{"w":"dedication","pos":"n.","def":"hard work and strong commitment","cn":"奉獻；專注投入","s":"Her ______ to the small bakery was amazing, because she woke up at four every morning for ten years.","zh":"她對這家小麵包店的投入令人驚嘆，因為十年來她每天凌晨四點就起床。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"投入","a":["dedication"]},{"w":"deliverable","pos":"n.","def":"a piece of work you must complete and hand over","cn":"交付成果","s":"The first ______ of the project is a simple website, and the client wants to see it by next Monday.","zh":"這個專案的第一項交付成果是一個簡單的網站，而客戶想在下週一前看到它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"交付成果","a":["deliverable"]},{"w":"diligence","pos":"n.","def":"careful and steady effort","cn":"勤奮；盡職","s":"Thanks to his ______, the young clerk found an error worth a million dollars, so the boss gave him a reward.","zh":"多虧他的勤奮，這位年輕職員發現了一筆價值百萬元的錯誤，所以老闆給了他獎勵。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"勤奮","a":["diligence"]},{"w":"diminishing","pos":"adj.","def":"becoming smaller or less","cn":"遞減的","s":"The company spent more and more on adverts, but it saw ______ results, so it stopped the campaign.","zh":"公司在廣告上花得越來越多，但看到的效果卻遞減，所以它停止了這個活動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"遞減","a":["diminishing"]},{"w":"dissatisfied","pos":"adj.","def":"not happy with something","cn":"不滿意的","s":"______ customers often tell their friends about bad service, so the shop trains its staff to solve problems quickly.","zh":"不滿意的顧客常會把糟糕的服務告訴朋友，所以這家店訓練員工迅速解決問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"不滿意的","a":["Dissatisfied"]},{"w":"diversified","pos":"adj.","def":"having many different types of business","cn":"多元化的","s":"The company is ______, selling food, clothes and electronics, so a bad year in one area does not hurt it much.","zh":"這家公司經營多元化，販售食品、服飾和電子產品，所以某一領域表現不佳不太會影響它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"多元化","a":["diversified"]},{"w":"dynamism","pos":"n.","def":"energy and new ideas","cn":"活力；動力","s":"The city's young population gives its economy great ______, and new cafés and studios open every month.","zh":"這座城市的年輕人口為它的經濟帶來極大的活力，而且每個月都有新咖啡店和工作室開幕。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"活力","a":["dynamism"]},{"w":"economical","pos":"adj.","def":"not using much money or fuel","cn":"節省的；經濟實惠的","s":"The small car is very ______ to run, so delivery companies use it for short trips in the city.","zh":"這款小車開起來非常省錢，所以快遞公司在市區短程配送時使用它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"省錢","a":["economical"]},{"w":"entice","pos":"v.","def":"to attract someone by offering something good","cn":"引誘；吸引","s":"The shop used free gifts to ______ customers inside, and most of them ended up buying something.","zh":"那家店用免費贈品吸引顧客進來，而他們大多數最後都買了東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"吸引","a":["entice"]},{"w":"excess","pos":"adj.","def":"more than is needed","cn":"過剩的；多餘的","s":"The factory sells its ______ stock to discount shops, so it does not waste goods that nobody ordered.","zh":"工廠把過剩的存貨賣給折扣商店，所以不會浪費沒人訂購的商品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"過剩的","a":["excess"]},{"w":"financier","pos":"n.","def":"a person who provides large amounts of money for business","cn":"金融家","s":"A wealthy ______ paid for the new stadium, but he wanted his company's name on the front of it.","zh":"一位富有的金融家出資興建新體育館，但他希望把公司名稱放在場館正面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"金融家","a":["financier"]},{"w":"goodwill","pos":"n.","def":"friendly feelings toward a business","cn":"商譽；善意","s":"The shop gave free meals to firefighters, and this act of ______ made many locals become loyal customers.","zh":"那家店提供免費餐點給消防員，而這份善意讓許多當地人成為忠實顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"善意","a":["goodwill"]},{"w":"headhunt","pos":"v.","def":"to find and offer a job to a skilled person from another company","cn":"挖角","s":"A rival firm tried to ______ our best engineer, so our boss offered her a higher salary to stay.","zh":"一家競爭公司試圖挖角我們最優秀的工程師，所以老闆提供她更高的薪水讓她留下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"挖角","a":["headhunt"]},{"w":"incumbent","pos":"adj.","def":"currently holding a position or leading a market","cn":"現任的；在位的","s":"The ______ phone company had controlled the market for years, but a new rival quickly won young customers.","zh":"那家在位的電信公司多年來掌控市場，但一家新對手很快就贏得了年輕顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"在位的","a":["incumbent"]},{"w":"indebted","pos":"adj.","def":"owing money","cn":"負債的","s":"Many students are heavily ______ after university, so they take any job to pay back their loans.","zh":"許多學生大學畢業後背負沉重債務，所以他們接受任何工作來償還貸款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"債務","a":["indebted"]},{"w":"inflate","pos":"v.","def":"to make prices or numbers higher than they should be","cn":"抬高；灌水","s":"Some hotels ______ their prices during festivals, so smart travellers book their rooms months earlier.","zh":"有些飯店在節慶期間抬高價格，所以精明的旅客會提前幾個月訂房。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"抬高","a":["inflate"]},{"w":"insolvency","pos":"n.","def":"being unable to pay what you owe","cn":"無力償債","s":"The shoe shop faced ______ after sales dropped, but a larger company bought it and saved most jobs.","zh":"銷售下滑後這家鞋店面臨無力償債，但一家較大的公司收購了它並保住大部分工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"無力償債","a":["insolvency"]},{"w":"marketable","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to sell, or attractive to employers","cn":"有市場的；好賣的","s":"Learning to code makes students more ______, because many companies need people who understand software.","zh":"學習寫程式讓學生更有市場，因為許多公司需要懂軟體的人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"有市場","a":["marketable"]},{"w":"negotiable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be changed through discussion","cn":"可議的","s":"The salary in the advert is ______, so experienced applicants can ask for more money at the interview.","zh":"廣告中的薪資可議，所以有經驗的應徵者可以在面試時要求更高的薪水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"可議","a":["negotiable"]},{"w":"negotiation","pos":"n.","def":"discussion to reach an agreement","cn":"協商","s":"The ______ between the two companies lasted three months, but in the end they agreed to work together.","zh":"兩家公司之間的協商持續了三個月，但最終他們同意合作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"協商","a":["negotiation"]},{"w":"ownership","pos":"n.","def":"the fact of owning something","cn":"所有權","s":"The ______ of the football club changed last year, and the new owners promised to build a bigger stadium.","zh":"這家足球俱樂部的所有權去年易主，而新老闆承諾要蓋更大的體育館。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"所有權","a":["ownership"]},{"w":"payable","pos":"adj.","def":"that must be paid","cn":"應付的","s":"The rent is ______ on the first day of each month, so the shop owner sets a reminder on his phone.","zh":"房租是每月第一天應付的，所以店主在手機上設定了提醒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"應付的","a":["payable"]},{"w":"persuasion","pos":"n.","def":"the act of making someone agree or believe","cn":"說服","s":"It took a lot of ______ to convince my grandmother to shop online, but now she orders vegetables every week.","zh":"花了好一番說服才讓奶奶願意網購，但現在她每週都訂蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"說服","a":["persuasion"]},{"w":"profitability","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to make a profit","cn":"獲利能力","s":"The airline cut unpopular routes to improve its ______, and it made money for the first time in five years.","zh":"航空公司刪減冷門航線來改善獲利能力，而且五年來首次賺錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"獲利能力","a":["profitability"]},{"w":"recoup","pos":"v.","def":"to get back money you have spent or lost","cn":"收回；彌補","s":"The film cost a fortune to make, but it ______ its costs in the first week because millions of people saw it.","zh":"這部電影耗資巨大，但它在第一週就收回了成本，因為數百萬人看了它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"收回","a":["recouped"]},{"w":"redundancy","pos":"n.","def":"losing your job because it is no longer needed","cn":"裁員；資遣","s":"The bank offered ______ to two hundred staff after it closed many branches, and each person received extra pay.","zh":"銀行關閉許多分行後對兩百名員工提出資遣，而且每個人都得到額外補償。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"資遣","a":["redundancy"]},{"w":"reinvest","pos":"v.","def":"to put profits back into a business","cn":"再投資","s":"Instead of buying a new car, the owner decided to ______ the profit in better coffee machines.","zh":"老闆沒有買新車，而是決定把利潤再投資在更好的咖啡機上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"再投資","a":["reinvest"]},{"w":"remuneration","pos":"n.","def":"payment for work","cn":"報酬","s":"The ______ for the job includes a good salary and a car, so many experienced managers applied for it.","zh":"這份工作的報酬包括優渥的薪水和一輛車，所以許多資深經理應徵了這個職位。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"報酬","a":["remuneration"]},{"w":"renegotiate","pos":"v.","def":"to discuss and change an agreement again","cn":"重新協商","s":"When rents rose, the café owner tried to ______ her contract, and the landlord agreed to a smaller increase.","zh":"房租上漲時，咖啡店老闆試著重新協商合約，而房東同意了較小的漲幅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"重新協商","a":["renegotiate"]},{"w":"saturated","pos":"adj.","def":"having so many products that no more can be sold","cn":"飽和的","s":"The bubble tea market is ______ in this area, so a new shop must offer something special to survive.","zh":"這一區的珍奶市場已經飽和，所以新店必須提供特別的東西才能生存。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"飽和","a":["saturated"]},{"w":"solvent","pos":"adj.","def":"having enough money to pay all debts","cn":"有償債能力的","s":"The company stayed ______ during the crisis because it had saved money in good years.","zh":"這家公司在危機期間保持有償債能力，因為它在好年頭有存錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"有償債能力","a":["solvent"]},{"w":"tender","pos":"n.","def":"a formal offer to do work at a stated price","cn":"投標","s":"Five companies sent in a ______ to build the new bridge, and the city chose the one with the best safety plan.","zh":"五家公司提出了建造新橋的投標，而市政府選擇了安全計畫最好的那一家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"投標","a":["tender"]},{"w":"thriving","pos":"adj.","def":"growing and doing very well","cn":"蓬勃發展的","s":"The once-quiet street now has a ______ night market, and visitors come from all over the island.","zh":"這條曾經冷清的街道現在有個蓬勃發展的夜市，而遊客從全島各地前來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"蓬勃發展的","a":["thriving"]},{"w":"turnaround","pos":"n.","def":"a big improvement after a bad period","cn":"好轉；轉虧為盈","s":"The new boss led an amazing ______, and the shop that was losing money is now one of the best in town.","zh":"新老闆帶來了驚人的轉虧為盈，而那家原本虧錢的店現在是鎮上最好的店之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"轉虧為盈","a":["turnaround"]},{"w":"unprofitable","pos":"adj.","def":"not making a profit","cn":"無利可圖的","s":"The company closed its ______ stores in small towns, but it opened bigger ones in the cities.","zh":"公司關閉了小鎮裡無利可圖的門市，但在城市開了更大的店。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"無利可圖的","a":["unprofitable"]},{"w":"upturn","pos":"n.","def":"an improvement in business or the economy","cn":"好轉；上揚","s":"There was an ______ in hotel bookings after the borders reopened, so the staff who had left were rehired.","zh":"邊境重新開放後飯店訂房出現好轉，所以先前離職的員工被重新雇用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"好轉","a":["upturn"]},{"w":"windfall","pos":"n.","def":"an unexpected amount of money","cn":"意外之財","s":"The family received a ______ when their old land was bought for a new railway, so they paid off their debts.","zh":"這家人的舊土地被收購來建新鐵路，他們得到一筆意外之財，所以還清了債務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"意外之財","a":["windfall"]},{"w":"acknowledgement","pos":"n.","def":"a message saying you have received something","cn":"回執；確認通知","s":"The company sent an ______ of my application by email, but I did not hear anything more for a month.","zh":"公司用電子郵件寄來我申請的確認通知，但之後一個月我都沒再收到任何消息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"確認通知","a":["acknowledgement"]},{"w":"adaptability","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to change to suit new situations","cn":"適應力","s":"Employers value ______, because markets change quickly and workers must learn new tools every year.","zh":"雇主重視適應力，因為市場變化很快，員工每年都必須學習新工具。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"適應力","a":["adaptability"]},{"w":"administrative","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to office work and managing an organisation","cn":"行政的","s":"Teachers spend many hours on ______ tasks like filling in forms, so they have less time to plan lessons.","zh":"老師花很多時間在填表等行政工作上，所以他們備課的時間變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"行政","a":["administrative"]},{"w":"affiliation","pos":"n.","def":"an official connection with a group or company","cn":"隸屬關係","s":"The hotel has an ______ with a famous international chain, so guests can collect points for free nights.","zh":"這家飯店與一家國際知名連鎖集團有隸屬關係，所以房客可以累積點數換取免費住宿。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"隸屬關係","a":["affiliation"]},{"w":"authorisation","pos":"n.","def":"official permission","cn":"授權；許可","s":"You need your manager's ______ to spend more than ten thousand dollars, so please send her an email first.","zh":"花費超過一萬元需要經理的授權，所以請先寄電子郵件給她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"授權","a":["authorisation"]},{"w":"budgetary","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to a budget","cn":"預算的","s":"Because of ______ limits, the school could not buy new computers, so students shared the old ones.","zh":"由於預算限制，學校無法購買新電腦，所以學生們共用舊電腦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"預算","a":["budgetary"]},{"w":"commercially","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that makes money","cn":"在商業上","s":"The film was praised by critics, but it was not ______ successful, because few people bought tickets.","zh":"這部電影受到影評人稱讚，但它在商業上並不成功，因為很少人買票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"在商業上","a":["commercially"]},{"w":"depreciation","pos":"n.","def":"a fall in the value of something over time","cn":"折舊","s":"A new car suffers fast ______, so it may be worth only half its price after three years.","zh":"新車折舊很快，所以三年後可能只值原價的一半。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"折舊","a":["depreciation"]},{"w":"liquidity","pos":"n.","def":"having money available to spend quickly","cn":"流動性；資金周轉","s":"The shop had plenty of stock but little ______, so it could not pay its suppliers on time.","zh":"這家店有很多存貨，但資金周轉不足，所以無法準時付款給供應商。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"資金周轉","a":["liquidity"]},{"w":"opportunistic","pos":"adj.","def":"using chances for your own advantage","cn":"投機的","s":"Some ______ sellers raised the price of masks during the outbreak, but the government quickly fined them.","zh":"有些投機的賣家在疫情爆發期間抬高口罩價格，但政府很快就罰了他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"投機的","a":["opportunistic"]},{"w":"opportunity","pos":"n.","def":"a chance to do something good","cn":"機會","s":"The trade fair was a great ______ to meet buyers, so the small company brought hundreds of samples.","zh":"這場貿易展是結識買家的好機會，所以這家小公司帶了數百件樣品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"機會","a":["opportunity"]},{"w":"oversupply","pos":"n.","def":"too much of something for the demand","cn":"供過於求","s":"An ______ of mangoes this summer made prices fall, so farmers turned many of them into juice and dried fruit.","zh":"今年夏天芒果供過於求導致價格下跌，所以農民把許多芒果做成果汁和果乾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"供過於求","a":["oversupply"]},{"w":"overvalue","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is worth more than it is","cn":"高估","s":"Investors may ______ new tech companies, and when reality appears, their share prices can fall quickly.","zh":"投資人可能會高估新科技公司，而當現實出現時，它們的股價可能迅速下跌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"高估","a":["overvalue"]},{"w":"pricing","pos":"n.","def":"deciding how much to charge for something","cn":"定價","s":"The gym changed its ______ to attract students, so now a monthly pass costs half the old price.","zh":"健身房改變了定價來吸引學生，所以現在月票只要原價的一半。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"定價","a":["pricing"]},{"w":"prosperous","pos":"adj.","def":"rich and successful","cn":"繁榮的；富裕的","s":"The port town became ______ when the factory opened, and many families could afford new homes.","zh":"工廠開設後這座港口小鎮變得繁榮，而許多家庭有能力買新房子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"繁榮","a":["prosperous"]},{"w":"underperform","pos":"v.","def":"to do less well than expected","cn":"表現不佳","s":"Shares in the company continued to ______ this year, so some investors sold them and bought others.","zh":"這家公司的股票今年持續表現不佳，所以有些投資人賣掉它們改買其他股票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"表現不佳","a":["underperform"]},{"w":"upfront","pos":"adv.","def":"paid or done before the work starts","cn":"預先地","s":"The builder asked us to pay half the money ______, and we would pay the rest when the kitchen was finished.","zh":"營造商要求我們預先支付一半的錢，剩下的在廚房完工時再付。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"預先","a":["upfront"]},{"w":"aggressively","pos":"adv.","def":"in a strong and determined way","cn":"積極地；強勢地","s":"The new coffee chain is expanding ______, opening a shop on almost every corner, so local cafés are worried.","zh":"新咖啡連鎖店正強勢地擴張，幾乎在每個街角都開店，所以本地咖啡店很擔心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"強勢地","a":["aggressively"]},{"w":"ally","pos":"n.","def":"a person or group that supports you","cn":"盟友","s":"The small farmers found an ______ in a big supermarket, which agreed to sell their vegetables at fair prices.","zh":"小農們在一家大型超市找到了盟友，它同意以公平價格販售他們的蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"盟友","a":["ally"]},{"w":"automatically","pos":"adv.","def":"by itself, without a person doing it","cn":"自動地","s":"The system ______ orders more paper when the supply is low, so the office never runs out.","zh":"系統會在存量不足時自動地訂購更多紙張，所以辦公室從不會缺紙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"自動地","a":["automatically"]},{"w":"confidence","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling that you can trust someone or something","cn":"信心","s":"When shoppers lose ______ in the economy, they spend less, and many shops see their sales fall.","zh":"當消費者對經濟失去信心時，他們會減少消費，而許多商店的銷售就會下滑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"信心","a":["confidence"]},{"w":"cutthroat","pos":"adj.","def":"very fierce and without kindness","cn":"割喉的；激烈的","s":"The food delivery business is ______, and companies offer huge discounts just to stop customers leaving.","zh":"外送產業競爭激烈，而且公司提供巨額折扣只為了留住顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"激烈","a":["cutthroat"]},{"w":"swift","pos":"adj.","def":"happening quickly","cn":"迅速的","s":"The company's ______ reply to the complaint impressed the customer, so she gave it five stars online.","zh":"公司對投訴的迅速回覆讓顧客印象深刻，所以她在網路上給了五顆星。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"迅速","a":["swift"]},{"w":"occupation","pos":"n.","def":"a person's job","cn":"職業","s":"Please write your ______ on the form, and the bank will use it to decide what kind of account suits you.","zh":"請在表格上填寫你的職業，而銀行會用它來決定哪種帳戶適合你。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"職業","a":["occupation"]},{"w":"partner","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company you work with in business","cn":"合夥人；合作夥伴","s":"She found a business ______ who was good at numbers, while she focused on designing the clothes.","zh":"她找到一位擅長數字的事業合夥人，而她則專注於設計服裝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"合夥人","a":["partner"]},{"w":"contact","pos":"v.","def":"to call, email or write to someone","cn":"聯絡","s":"If you have any questions about your order, please ______ our team, and we will reply within one day.","zh":"如果你對訂單有任何問題，請聯絡我們的團隊，我們會在一天內回覆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"聯絡","a":["contact"]},{"w":"advance","pos":"v.","def":"to move forward or make progress","cn":"晉升；進步","s":"She took evening classes in management because she wanted to ______ in her career, and she was promoted a year later.","zh":"她上了管理學夜間課程，因為她想在職涯中晉升，而一年後她就升職了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"晉升","a":["advance"]},{"w":"leadership","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to lead people","cn":"領導力；領導","s":"Under her ______, the small team won three national awards, so other companies tried to hire her.","zh":"在她的領導下，這個小團隊贏得了三項全國獎項，所以其他公司都想聘請她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"領導","a":["leadership"]},{"w":"liaison","pos":"n.","def":"communication between groups so they work well together","cn":"聯繫；聯絡","s":"Ben works as a ______ between the designers and the factory, so problems are solved before production starts.","zh":"阿班擔任設計師與工廠之間的聯絡窗口，所以問題在生產開始前就能解決。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"聯絡","a":["liaison"]},{"w":"paperwork","pos":"n.","def":"documents and forms you must complete","cn":"文書工作","s":"Opening a company involves a lot of ______, so many people pay an accountant to help them.","zh":"開公司涉及大量的文書工作，所以很多人付錢請會計師幫忙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"文書工作","a":["paperwork"]},{"w":"personnel","pos":"n.","def":"the people employed by an organisation","cn":"人員","s":"Only authorised ______ can enter the laboratory, so visitors must wait in the meeting room.","zh":"只有經授權的人員才能進入實驗室，所以訪客必須在會議室等候。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"人員","a":["personnel"]},{"w":"quotation","pos":"n.","def":"a statement of how much a job will cost","cn":"報價單","s":"We asked three builders for a ______, and then we chose the one who explained the costs most clearly.","zh":"我們向三家營造商要了報價單，然後選擇了把費用說明得最清楚的那一家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"報價單","a":["quotation"]},{"w":"appoint","pos":"v.","def":"to choose someone officially for a job","cn":"任命","s":"The board will ______ a new chief executive next month, and many people expect it to be a woman.","zh":"董事會將在下個月任命一位新執行長，而許多人預期會是一位女性。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"任命","a":["appoint"]},{"w":"award","pos":"v.","def":"to give something officially as a prize or contract","cn":"授予；給予","s":"The city decided to ______ the contract to a local company, so the new park will create jobs for residents.","zh":"市政府決定把合約授予一家本地公司，所以新公園將為居民創造工作機會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"授予","a":["award"]},{"w":"clinch","pos":"v.","def":"to finally win or agree on something","cn":"敲定；贏得","s":"Our sales team flew to Tokyo to ______ the deal, and they came back with a contract worth millions.","zh":"我們的業務團隊飛到東京去敲定這筆交易，而且他們帶回了一份價值數百萬的合約。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"敲定","a":["clinch"]},{"w":"engage","pos":"v.","def":"to attract and keep someone's interest","cn":"吸引；使參與","s":"Short videos ______ young viewers better than long adverts, so many brands now post daily clips.","zh":"短影片比長廣告更能吸引年輕觀眾，所以許多品牌現在每天發布短片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"吸引","a":["engage"]},{"w":"outbid","pos":"v.","def":"to offer more money than someone else","cn":"出價高過","s":"A wealthy collector managed to ______ the museum at the auction, so the painting went to a private home.","zh":"一位富有的收藏家在拍賣會上成功出價高過博物館，所以這幅畫流入私人宅邸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"出價高過","a":["outbid"]},{"w":"outsell","pos":"v.","def":"to sell more than another product or company","cn":"銷量超過","s":"Electric cars may soon ______ petrol cars in some countries, because they are cheaper to run.","zh":"在某些國家，電動車很快就可能銷量超過汽油車，因為它們的使用成本更低。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"銷量超過","a":["outsell"]},{"w":"overcharge","pos":"v.","def":"to ask for too much money","cn":"多收費；索價過高","s":"The taxi driver tried to ______ the tourists, but they checked the price on a map app and refused to pay.","zh":"計程車司機試圖對遊客多收費，但他們用地圖應用程式查了價格並拒絕付款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"多收費","a":["overcharge"]},{"w":"overspend","pos":"v.","def":"to spend more money than planned","cn":"超支","s":"Many families ______ during the holidays, and then they have to save hard in January.","zh":"許多家庭在假期期間超支，然後在一月就得努力省錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"超支","a":["overspend"]},{"w":"hike","pos":"v.","def":"to increase prices or taxes suddenly","cn":"調漲；大幅提高","s":"The airline decided to ______ its fares before the holiday, so many students chose to take the train instead.","zh":"航空公司決定在假期前調漲票價，所以許多學生改搭火車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"調漲","a":["hike"]},{"w":"slash","pos":"v.","def":"to reduce something a lot","cn":"大砍；大幅削減","s":"The shop will ______ prices on winter coats next week, so I am waiting before I buy one.","zh":"這家店下週將大砍冬季外套的價格，所以我要等一等再買。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"大砍","a":["slash"]},{"w":"dip","pos":"v.","def":"to go down slightly for a short time","cn":"小幅下滑","s":"Sales usually ______ in February after the holidays, but they rise again when the weather gets warmer.","zh":"銷售通常在假期後的二月小幅下滑，但天氣轉暖時又會回升。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"小幅下滑","a":["dip"]},{"w":"tumble","pos":"v.","def":"to fall quickly in value","cn":"暴跌","s":"Share prices began to ______ after the bad news, and some investors lost half their money in a week.","zh":"壞消息傳出後股價開始暴跌，而有些投資人一週內損失了一半的錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"暴跌","a":["tumble"]},{"w":"triple","pos":"v.","def":"to become three times bigger","cn":"增為三倍","s":"Online orders ______ during the lockdown, so the company had to hire more drivers and pack faster.","zh":"封城期間線上訂單增為三倍，所以公司必須雇用更多司機並加快打包速度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"增為三倍","a":["tripled"]},{"w":"divest","pos":"v.","def":"to sell part of a business or investment","cn":"撤資；出售","s":"The company decided to ______ its oil business, because it wanted to focus on clean energy.","zh":"公司決定出售它的石油事業，因為它想專注於潔淨能源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"出售","a":["divest"]},{"w":"bill","pos":"v.","def":"to send someone a request for payment","cn":"開帳單給","s":"The plumber will ______ us at the end of the month, so we do not have to pay him today.","zh":"水電工會在月底開帳單給我們，所以我們今天不用付錢給他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"開帳單給","a":["bill"]},{"w":"charge","pos":"v.","def":"to ask an amount of money for something","cn":"收費","s":"Some airlines ______ extra for bags, so passengers try to fit everything into one small suitcase.","zh":"有些航空公司對行李額外收費，所以乘客試著把所有東西塞進一個小行李箱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"收費","a":["charge"]},{"w":"afford","pos":"v.","def":"to have enough money to pay for something","cn":"負擔得起","s":"Young couples in big cities often cannot ______ a flat, so many of them live with their parents for years.","zh":"大城市的年輕夫妻常常負擔不起一間公寓，所以他們很多人和父母同住好幾年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"負擔不起","a":["afford"]},{"w":"owe","pos":"v.","def":"to have to pay money back to someone","cn":"欠","s":"The shop still ______ its supplier a lot of money, but it promised to pay everything after the holiday sales.","zh":"這家店仍欠供應商很多錢，但它承諾在假期促銷後全部付清。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"欠","a":["owes"]},{"w":"deduct","pos":"v.","def":"to take an amount away from a total","cn":"扣除","s":"The company will ______ the cost of the uniform from your first salary, so you will receive a little less.","zh":"公司會從你的第一份薪水中扣除制服的費用，所以你會領得少一點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"扣除","a":["deduct"]},{"w":"veto","pos":"v.","def":"to officially refuse to allow something","cn":"否決","s":"The chairperson can ______ any plan she thinks is too risky, but she usually listens to the team first.","zh":"主席可以否決任何她認為風險太高的計畫，但她通常會先聽取團隊的意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"否決","a":["veto"]},{"w":"underwrite","pos":"v.","def":"to agree to pay for losses or costs if needed","cn":"承保；擔保","s":"A large insurer agreed to ______ the concert, so the organisers would not lose money if it rained.","zh":"一家大型保險公司同意為這場演唱會承保，所以即使下雨主辦單位也不會賠錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"承保","a":["underwrite"]},{"w":"settle","pos":"v.","def":"to pay money that you owe","cn":"結清；支付","s":"Please ______ your bill before you leave the hotel, and you can pay by card or in cash.","zh":"請在離開飯店前結清你的帳單，你可以刷卡或付現。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"結清","a":["settle"]},{"w":"motivate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone want to work hard","cn":"激勵","s":"Bonuses can ______ staff for a short time, but many workers say interesting tasks matter more.","zh":"獎金可以在短時間內激勵員工，但許多員工說有趣的任務更重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"激勵","a":["motivate"]},{"w":"lure","pos":"v.","def":"to attract someone with something tempting","cn":"引誘","s":"The tech company tried to ______ top graduates with free meals and a gym, and many accepted its offers.","zh":"這家科技公司試圖用免費餐點和健身房來引誘頂尖畢業生，而且許多人接受了它的錄用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"引誘","a":["lure"]},{"w":"deliver","pos":"v.","def":"to do what you promised","cn":"兌現；履行承諾","s":"The new phone did not ______ the long battery life it promised, so many angry buyers asked for refunds.","zh":"新手機沒有兌現它承諾的長效電池續航力，所以許多憤怒的買家要求退款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"兌現","a":["deliver"]},{"w":"resell","pos":"v.","def":"to sell something you have bought","cn":"轉售","s":"Some people buy concert tickets only to ______ them at higher prices, so real fans cannot get seats.","zh":"有些人買演唱會門票只是為了以更高價格轉售，所以真正的歌迷買不到位子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"轉售","a":["resell"]},{"w":"booming","pos":"adj.","def":"growing very fast and successfully","cn":"蓬勃的；興旺的","s":"Tourism is ______ on the island, so new hotels and restaurants are opening along the beach.","zh":"島上的觀光業正蓬勃發展，所以海灘沿線陸續開了新飯店和餐廳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"蓬勃發展","a":["booming"]},{"w":"high-profile","pos":"adj.","def":"well known and getting a lot of attention","cn":"高知名度的","s":"The brand hired a ______ actor for its advert, but the campaign cost more than the whole year's budget.","zh":"這個品牌為廣告請來一位高知名度的演員，但這個活動的花費超過了整年的預算。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"高知名度的","a":["high-profile"]},{"w":"nonprofit","pos":"adj.","def":"not working to make money for owners","cn":"非營利的","s":"She works for a ______ group that teaches farmers how to sell online, and any extra money goes back to them.","zh":"她在一個非營利團體工作，教農民如何在網路上販售，而任何結餘都回饋給他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"非營利","a":["nonprofit"]},{"w":"promising","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to be successful","cn":"有前途的","s":"The judges said the students' idea was very ______, and an investor offered to help them build it.","zh":"評審說學生們的點子非常有前途，而一位投資人主動提出幫他們實現。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"有前途","a":["promising"]},{"w":"seasoned","pos":"adj.","def":"having a lot of experience","cn":"經驗豐富的","s":"A ______ manager knows that problems will happen, so she always keeps extra time in the schedule.","zh":"一位經驗豐富的經理知道問題一定會發生，所以她總是在時程中預留額外時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"經驗豐富的","a":["seasoned"]},{"w":"sought-after","pos":"adj.","def":"wanted by many people","cn":"搶手的","s":"Engineers who understand AI are very ______ these days, and companies compete hard to hire and keep them.","zh":"懂人工智慧的工程師非常搶手，而且公司們激烈競爭來聘用他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"搶手","a":["sought-after"]},{"w":"wealthy","pos":"adj.","def":"having a lot of money","cn":"富有的","s":"The shop sells handbags to ______ tourists, but most local people cannot afford its prices.","zh":"這家店把手提包賣給富有的觀光客，但大多數本地人負擔不起它的價格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"富有的","a":["wealthy"]},{"w":"labour-intensive","pos":"adj.","def":"needing many workers","cn":"勞力密集的","s":"Making clothes by hand is ______, so many brands move their factories to countries with lower wages.","zh":"手工製衣是勞力密集的，所以許多品牌把工廠移到工資較低的國家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"勞力密集的","a":["labour-intensive"]},{"w":"capital-intensive","pos":"adj.","def":"needing a lot of money for machines and buildings","cn":"資本密集的","s":"Building computer chips is ______, so only a few huge companies can afford the factories.","zh":"製造電腦晶片是資本密集的，所以只有少數大公司負擔得起這些工廠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"資本密集的","a":["capital-intensive"]},{"w":"profit-driven","pos":"adj.","def":"mainly interested in making money","cn":"以獲利為導向的","s":"Critics say ______ companies ignore the environment, but some firms prove that green businesses can make money.","zh":"批評者說以獲利為導向的公司忽視環境，但有些企業證明綠色事業也能賺錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"以獲利為導向的","a":["profit-driven"]},{"w":"customer-focused","pos":"adj.","def":"paying close attention to what customers need","cn":"以顧客為中心的","s":"The bank became more ______ after the complaints, and now staff call customers back within an hour.","zh":"在收到投訴後，銀行變得更以顧客為中心，而現在員工會在一小時內回電給顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"以顧客為中心","a":["customer-focused"]},{"w":"cash-strapped","pos":"adj.","def":"not having enough money","cn":"缺錢的；手頭拮据的","s":"The ______ museum asked every visitor for donations, because the city had cut its funding last year.","zh":"這間缺錢的博物館向參觀者請求捐款，因為市政府削減了它的經費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"缺錢的","a":["cash-strapped"]},{"w":"loss-making","pos":"adj.","def":"losing money instead of making profit","cn":"虧損的","s":"The company sold its ______ toy department, so it could focus on games that earned money.","zh":"公司賣掉了虧損的玩具部門，以便專注於能賺錢的遊戲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"虧損的","a":["loss-making"]},{"w":"tax-free","pos":"adj.","def":"not taxed","cn":"免稅的","s":"Tourists can get ______ shopping at some department stores, so they bring their passports when they go shopping.","zh":"觀光客在某些百貨公司可以免稅購物，所以他們逛街時會帶著護照。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"免稅","a":["tax-free"]},{"w":"duty-free","pos":"adj.","def":"sold without import tax, often at airports","cn":"免關稅的","s":"My father always buys ______ chocolate at the airport, because it is cheaper than in the city.","zh":"我爸爸總是在機場買免稅巧克力，因為比市區便宜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"免稅","a":["duty-free"]},{"w":"second-hand","pos":"adj.","def":"owned by someone else before","cn":"二手的","s":"______ phones are popular with students, because they cost half the price and still work well.","zh":"二手手機很受學生歡迎，因為它們只要半價而且還很好用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"二手","a":["Second-hand"]},{"w":"brand-new","pos":"adj.","def":"completely new and not used","cn":"全新的","s":"He bought a ______ laptop for university, but he still uses his old one to play games.","zh":"他為了上大學買了一台全新的筆電，但他仍然用舊的那台玩遊戲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"全新的","a":["brand-new"]},{"w":"best-selling","pos":"adj.","def":"sold in very large numbers","cn":"最暢銷的","s":"The author's ______ book about saving money has been translated into twenty languages, so she is now famous worldwide.","zh":"這位作者關於存錢的最暢銷書籍已被翻譯成二十種語言，所以她現在全球知名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"最暢銷","a":["best-selling"]},{"w":"eye-catching","pos":"adj.","def":"attracting attention easily","cn":"吸睛的","s":"The shop's ______ window display made people stop and look, and many of them came inside.","zh":"這家店吸睛的櫥窗擺設讓人停下來觀看，而許多人走了進來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"吸睛的","a":["eye-catching"]},{"w":"user-friendly","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to use","cn":"容易使用的","s":"The ticket machine is ______, so even young children and tourists can buy tickets without help.","zh":"這台售票機很容易使用，所以即使小孩和觀光客也能自行買票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"容易使用","a":["user-friendly"]},{"w":"cost-conscious","pos":"adj.","def":"careful about spending money","cn":"注重成本的","s":"______ shoppers compare prices online before they buy anything, so shops must offer really good deals.","zh":"注重成本的消費者在購買前會先上網比價，所以商店必須提供好的優惠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"注重成本的","a":["Cost-conscious"]},{"w":"risk-averse","pos":"adj.","def":"not wanting to take risks","cn":"規避風險的","s":"My parents are ______ investors, so they keep most of their money in the bank instead of buying shares.","zh":"我爸媽是規避風險的投資人，所以他們把大部分的錢存在銀行而不是買股票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"規避風險的","a":["risk-averse"]},{"w":"forward-thinking","pos":"adj.","def":"planning for the future with new ideas","cn":"有遠見的","s":"The ______ mayor invested in electric buses early, and now the city has some of the cleanest air in the country.","zh":"那位有遠見的市長很早就投資電動公車，而現在這座城市擁有全國數一數二乾淨的空氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"有遠見的","a":["forward-thinking"]},{"w":"high-end","pos":"adj.","def":"expensive and of high quality","cn":"高檔的","s":"The ______ restaurant charges a lot for each dish, but it uses only the best local ingredients.","zh":"這家高檔的餐廳每道菜都收費很高，但它只使用最好的在地食材。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"高檔的","a":["high-end"]},{"w":"low-cost","pos":"adj.","def":"cheap","cn":"低成本的；廉價的","s":"______ airlines have made travel much cheaper, but passengers must pay extra for food and bags.","zh":"廉價航空讓旅行變得更便宜，但乘客必須額外支付餐點和行李費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"廉價","a":["Low-cost"]},{"w":"mass-market","pos":"adj.","def":"made for and sold to very many people","cn":"大眾市場的","s":"The company makes ______ shoes in huge numbers, so it can keep prices low for ordinary families.","zh":"這家公司大量生產大眾市場的鞋子，所以能為一般家庭維持低價。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"大眾市場的","a":["mass-market"]},{"w":"in-house","pos":"adj.","def":"done by a company's own staff","cn":"公司內部的","s":"The firm has an ______ design team, so it does not need to pay outside agencies for its adverts.","zh":"這家公司有內部的設計團隊，所以不需要付錢請外部廣告公司做廣告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"內部的","a":["in-house"]},{"w":"off-the-shelf","pos":"adj.","def":"ready-made and available to buy","cn":"現成的","s":"The shop used ______ software for its website, because building its own system would cost too much.","zh":"這家店的網站用了現成的軟體，因為自己建置系統的成本太高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"現成的","a":["off-the-shelf"]},{"w":"world-class","pos":"adj.","def":"among the best in the world","cn":"世界級的","s":"The city wants to build a ______ convention centre, so it can hold big international trade fairs.","zh":"這座城市想建造一座世界級的會展中心，以便舉辦大型國際貿易展。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"世界級的","a":["world-class"]},{"w":"top-down","pos":"adj.","def":"controlled by leaders at the top","cn":"由上而下的","s":"The company used a ______ style, so workers rarely shared ideas, and many talented people left.","zh":"這家公司採用由上而下的管理風格，所以員工很少分享想法，而許多人才離開了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"由上而下的","a":["top-down"]},{"w":"bottom-up","pos":"adj.","def":"starting from ordinary workers or people","cn":"由下而上的","s":"The school took a ______ approach, and students suggested most of the changes to the cafeteria menu.","zh":"學校採取由下而上的方式，而學生提出了大部分餐廳菜單的改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"由下而上的","a":["bottom-up"]},{"w":"hands-off","pos":"adj.","def":"not getting involved in details","cn":"放手的；不干涉的","s":"Our boss has a ______ style, so we can decide how to do our work as long as we meet deadlines.","zh":"我們老闆的風格是放手的，所以只要我們準時完成，就可以自己決定怎麼做事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"放手的","a":["hands-off"]},{"w":"well-established","pos":"adj.","def":"existing for a long time and respected","cn":"歷史悠久且穩固的","s":"The ______ bakery has served the town for sixty years, but it now also sells cakes online.","zh":"這家歷史悠久的麵包店已為鎮上服務六十年，但它現在也在網路上賣蛋糕。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"歷史悠久的","a":["well-established"]},{"w":"time-sensitive","pos":"adj.","def":"needing to be done quickly","cn":"有時效性的","s":"This offer is ______, so if you do not reply by Friday, the discount will no longer be available.","zh":"這個優惠有時效性，所以如果你週五前沒有回覆，折扣就不再適用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"有時效性","a":["time-sensitive"]},{"w":"financially","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way related to money","cn":"在財務上","s":"Many young adults want to be ______ independent, so they take part-time jobs while studying.","zh":"許多年輕人想要在財務上獨立，所以他們在求學期間兼職打工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"在財務上","a":["financially"]},{"w":"economically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way related to the economy","cn":"在經濟上","s":"The new port is ______ important for the region, because it will bring jobs and trade to small towns.","zh":"這座新港口在經濟上對地區很重要，因為它會為小鎮帶來工作和貿易。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"在經濟上","a":["economically"]},{"w":"profitably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that makes a profit","cn":"有利潤地","s":"The farm now runs ______ because it sells directly to customers, so it no longer depends on middlemen.","zh":"這座農場現在有利潤地經營，因為它直接賣給顧客，所以不再依賴中間商。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"有利潤地","a":["profitably"]},{"w":"competitively","pos":"adv.","def":"at a price similar to or lower than rivals","cn":"具競爭力地","s":"The new phone is ______ priced, so it may attract buyers who usually choose more famous brands.","zh":"這款新手機的定價具競爭力，所以可能會吸引通常選擇更知名品牌的買家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"具競爭力","a":["competitively"]},{"w":"strategically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a carefully planned way","cn":"策略性地","s":"The shop is ______ located near two schools, so it is busy every afternoon when classes finish.","zh":"這家店策略性地設在兩所學校附近，所以每天下午放學時都很忙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"策略性地","a":["strategically"]},{"w":"internationally","pos":"adv.","def":"in many countries","cn":"在國際上","s":"The Taiwanese bicycle brand is now sold ______, and it sponsors races in Europe and America.","zh":"這個台灣自行車品牌現在在國際上銷售，而且它在歐美贊助賽事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"在國際上","a":["internationally"]},{"w":"locally","pos":"adv.","def":"in the nearby area","cn":"在當地","s":"The restaurant buys its vegetables ______, so the food is fresher and farmers earn more money.","zh":"這家餐廳在當地採購蔬菜，所以食物更新鮮，農民也賺得更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"在當地","a":["locally"]},{"w":"marginally","pos":"adv.","def":"only a little","cn":"稍微地","s":"Prices rose only ______ this year, but many families still felt that life was getting harder.","zh":"今年物價只稍微上漲，但許多家庭仍然覺得生活越來越辛苦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"稍微","a":["marginally"]},{"w":"currently","pos":"adv.","def":"at the present time","cn":"目前","s":"The company is ______ looking for summer interns, so students should send their CVs before May.","zh":"這家公司目前正在招募暑期實習生，所以學生應在五月前寄出履歷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"目前","a":["currently"]},{"w":"successfully","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that achieves what you wanted","cn":"成功地","s":"The team ______ launched the app on time, and it had ten thousand users by the end of the week.","zh":"團隊準時成功地推出了應用程式，而且到週末已經有一萬名使用者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"成功地","a":["successfully"]},{"w":"jointly","pos":"adv.","def":"together with others","cn":"共同地","s":"The two companies ______ own the new factory, so they share both the costs and the profits.","zh":"兩家公司共同擁有這座新工廠，所以他們共同分擔成本和利潤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"共同","a":["jointly"]},{"w":"individually","pos":"adv.","def":"separately, one by one","cn":"個別地","s":"Each cake is wrapped ______, so customers can buy just one and keep the rest fresh.","zh":"每塊蛋糕都個別包裝，所以顧客可以只買一塊，其餘的也能保持新鮮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"個別","a":["individually"]},{"w":"privately","pos":"adv.","def":"owned by a person, not the government","cn":"私人地","s":"The hospital is ______ owned, so patients often pay more, but they usually wait less.","zh":"這家醫院是私人擁有的，所以病人常常要付更多錢，但通常等候較短。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"私人","a":["privately"]},{"w":"ethically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a morally right way","cn":"合乎道德地","s":"The brand says its coffee is ______ sourced, so farmers receive a fair price for their beans.","zh":"這個品牌說它的咖啡是合乎道德地採購的，所以農民能為他們的咖啡豆得到公平價格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"合乎道德地","a":["ethically"]},{"w":"responsibly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a careful and sensible way","cn":"負責任地","s":"Banks should lend money ______, because people who borrow too much can lose their homes.","zh":"銀行應該負責任地放款，因為借太多錢的人可能會失去他們的房子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"負責任地","a":["responsibly"]},{"w":"know-how","pos":"n.","def":"practical knowledge and skill","cn":"專業技術；訣竅","s":"The small company lacked the ______ to sell abroad, so it hired an experienced export manager.","zh":"這家小公司缺乏海外銷售的專業技術，所以它聘請了一位有經驗的出口經理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"專業技術","a":["know-how"]},{"w":"networking","pos":"n.","def":"meeting people who may help your career","cn":"建立人脈","s":"______ events help young designers meet clients, so my sister goes to one every month.","zh":"建立人脈的活動幫助年輕設計師認識客戶，所以我姊姊每個月都去參加一場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"建立人脈","a":["Networking"]},{"w":"professionalism","pos":"n.","def":"the skill and good behaviour expected at work","cn":"專業素養","s":"The staff dealt with the angry customer with great ______, and he calmed down and apologised.","zh":"員工以極佳的專業素養處理那位憤怒的顧客，而他冷靜下來並道了歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"專業素養","a":["professionalism"]},{"w":"punctuality","pos":"n.","def":"being on time","cn":"準時","s":"Japanese trains are famous for their ______, so passengers expect an apology if a train is one minute late.","zh":"日本的火車以準時聞名，所以列車晚一分鐘乘客就會期待道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"準時","a":["punctuality"]},{"w":"resourcefulness","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to find clever ways to solve problems","cn":"足智多謀；應變能力","s":"With little money but great ______, the students turned old boxes into furniture and sold it at the market.","zh":"這些學生雖然缺錢但極有應變能力，他們把舊箱子做成家具並在市集販售。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"應變能力","a":["resourcefulness"]},{"w":"arrangement","pos":"n.","def":"an agreement about how something will be done","cn":"安排；協議","s":"The two shops have an ______ to share delivery drivers, so both of them save money every month.","zh":"兩家店有一項共用送貨司機的協議，所以雙方每個月都能省錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"協議","a":["arrangement"]},{"w":"supplier","pos":"n.","def":"a company that provides goods to another company","cn":"供應商","s":"Our main ______ raised the price of flour, so the bakery had to charge a little more for bread.","zh":"我們的主要供應商調漲了麵粉價格，所以麵包店不得不把麵包賣貴一點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"供應商","a":["supplier"]},{"w":"vendor","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that sells something","cn":"賣家；廠商","s":"The school chose a new ______ for its lunch boxes, because parents complained the old food was too oily.","zh":"學校為便當選擇了一家新廠商，因為家長抱怨以前的食物太油。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"廠商","a":["vendor"]},{"w":"arrears","pos":"n.","def":"money that should already have been paid","cn":"欠款","s":"The family fell into ______ on their rent after the father lost his job, so a charity helped them.","zh":"父親失業後，這家人積欠了房租欠款，所以一個慈善團體幫助了他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"欠款","a":["arrears"]},{"w":"creditor","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that is owed money","cn":"債權人","s":"When the company closed, each ______ received only part of the money they were owed, so many were angry.","zh":"公司倒閉時，每位債權人只拿回部分欠款，所以很多人很生氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"債權人","a":["creditor"]},{"w":"debtor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who owes money","cn":"債務人","s":"The bank gave the ______ more time to pay, because he had lost his job but was looking for a new one.","zh":"銀行給了那位債務人更多時間還款，因為他失業了但正在找新工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"債務人","a":["debtor"]},{"w":"instalment","pos":"n.","def":"one of several payments for something","cn":"分期付款","s":"We are paying for the sofa in monthly ______, so it will be fully ours after one year.","zh":"我們用每月分期付款的方式買沙發，所以一年後它就完全屬於我們了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"分期付款","a":["instalments"]},{"w":"lump sum","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large amount of money paid at one time","cn":"一次付清的款項","s":"When he retired, he received a ______ ______ from the company, and he used it to open a small tea shop.","zh":"他退休時從公司領到一筆一次付清的款項，而他用這筆錢開了一家小茶店。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"一次付清的款項","a":["lump","sum"]},{"w":"proceeds","pos":"n.","def":"money received from selling something or an event","cn":"收益","s":"All ______ from the charity concert will go to the children's hospital, so the tickets sold out quickly.","zh":"慈善音樂會的所有收益都將捐給兒童醫院，所以門票很快就賣光了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"收益","a":["proceeds"]},{"w":"profit margin","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the difference between cost and selling price","cn":"利潤率","s":"Bubble tea has a high ______ ______, because the ingredients are cheap but each drink sells for sixty dollars.","zh":"珍珠奶茶的利潤率很高，因為原料便宜，但每杯能賣六十元。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"利潤率","a":["profit","margin"]},{"w":"rebate","pos":"n.","def":"money given back to a buyer","cn":"退款；回饋金","s":"The government offers a ______ to people who buy energy-saving fridges, so many families replaced their old ones.","zh":"政府對購買節能冰箱的人提供回饋金，所以許多家庭換掉了舊冰箱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"回饋金","a":["rebate"]},{"w":"savings","pos":"n.","def":"money you have kept and not spent","cn":"存款；積蓄","s":"She used her ______ to start a small online shop, but she kept her day job until it made a profit.","zh":"她用自己的積蓄開了一家小網店，但在它獲利之前她仍保留白天的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"積蓄","a":["savings"]},{"w":"stake","pos":"n.","def":"a share in a business","cn":"股份","s":"The tech giant bought a ten percent ______ in the start-up, so it now has a seat on the board.","zh":"這家科技巨頭買下新創公司百分之十的股份，所以它現在在董事會有一席。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"股份","a":["stake"]},{"w":"surcharge","pos":"n.","def":"an extra amount added to the usual price","cn":"附加費","s":"The restaurant adds a ten percent ______ on public holidays, because staff must be paid more on those days.","zh":"這家餐廳在國定假日加收百分之十的附加費，因為那些天員工的薪資要更高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"附加費","a":["surcharge"]},{"w":"flagship","pos":"adj.","def":"the most important of a group of products or shops","cn":"旗艦的","s":"The brand opened its ______ store on the busiest street, and fans queued all night for the opening.","zh":"這個品牌在最熱鬧的街上開了它的旗艦店，而粉絲們為了開幕整晚排隊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"旗艦","a":["flagship"]},{"w":"successful","pos":"adj.","def":"achieving good results","cn":"成功的","s":"The ______ businesswoman gives free talks at schools, because she wants girls to believe they can run companies.","zh":"這位成功的女企業家在學校舉辦免費講座，因為她希望女孩們相信自己也能經營公司。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"成功的","a":["successful"]},{"w":"accomplishment","pos":"n.","def":"something achieved with effort","cn":"成就","s":"Opening a second shop was a great ______ for the young couple, and they celebrated with their staff.","zh":"開第二家店對這對年輕夫妻來說是一項了不起的成就，而他們和員工一起慶祝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"成就","a":["accomplishment"]},{"w":"assertiveness","pos":"n.","def":"speaking clearly and confidently about what you want","cn":"自信果斷","s":"Good salespeople need ______, but they must also listen carefully, or customers will feel pushed.","zh":"好的銷售員需要自信果斷，但他們也必須仔細聆聽，否則顧客會覺得被強迫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"自信果斷","a":["assertiveness"]},{"w":"cost-benefit","pos":"adj.","def":"comparing the costs and advantages of something","cn":"成本效益的","s":"The city did a ______ study of the new metro line, and it found the benefits were twice the costs.","zh":"市政府對新捷運線做了一份成本效益研究，而發現效益是成本的兩倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"成本效益","a":["cost-benefit"]},{"w":"courtesy","pos":"n.","def":"polite and kind behaviour","cn":"禮貌","s":"The hotel is famous for the ______ of its staff, so many guests return year after year.","zh":"這家飯店以員工的禮貌聞名，所以許多房客年年回訪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"禮貌","a":["courtesy"]},{"w":"decision-making","pos":"n.","def":"the process of making choices","cn":"決策","s":"Good data can improve ______ in a company, but managers still need common sense and experience.","zh":"好的數據可以改善公司的決策，但經理們仍需要常識和經驗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"決策","a":["decision-making"]},{"w":"exploitative","pos":"adj.","def":"treating people unfairly to gain profit","cn":"剝削的","s":"The factory was criticised for ______ working hours, so the brand promised to check all its suppliers.","zh":"這家工廠因剝削性的工時而受到批評，所以品牌承諾要檢查所有供應商。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"剝削性的","a":["exploitative"]},{"w":"frontrunner","pos":"n.","def":"the person or company most likely to win","cn":"領先者","s":"The local firm is the ______ for the new contract, but two foreign companies are still competing.","zh":"這家本地公司是新合約的領先者，但仍有兩家外國公司在競爭。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"領先者","a":["frontrunner"]},{"w":"hard-earned","pos":"adj.","def":"gained through a lot of hard work","cn":"辛苦賺來的","s":"Consumers want good value for their ______ money, so they read reviews before buying expensive things.","zh":"消費者希望辛苦賺來的錢能物有所值，所以他們在買昂貴的東西前會先看評論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"辛苦賺來的","a":["hard-earned"]},{"w":"incompetent","pos":"adj.","def":"not able to do a job well","cn":"無能的；不稱職的","s":"The ______ manager lost several important clients, so the company finally moved him to another role.","zh":"那位不稱職的經理流失了好幾位重要客戶，所以公司最後把他調到別的職位。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"不稱職的","a":["incompetent"]},{"w":"mismatch","pos":"n.","def":"a situation where two things do not fit well together","cn":"不匹配","s":"There is a ______ between the skills graduates have and the skills companies need, so many young people struggle to find jobs.","zh":"畢業生具備的技能與公司需要的技能之間不匹配，所以許多年輕人很難找到工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"不匹配","a":["mismatch"]},{"w":"overambitious","pos":"adj.","def":"trying to do more than is possible","cn":"野心過大的","s":"The plan to open fifty shops in a year was ______, and the company ran out of money halfway.","zh":"一年內開五十家店的計畫野心過大，而公司在半途就把錢用光了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"野心過大","a":["overambitious"]},{"w":"payback","pos":"n.","def":"the return of money you invested","cn":"回本","s":"Solar panels are expensive at first, but the ______ comes within eight years because electricity bills fall.","zh":"太陽能板一開始很貴，但八年內就能回本，因為電費會下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"回本","a":["payback"]},{"w":"profiteering","pos":"n.","def":"making unfair profits, especially in hard times","cn":"牟取暴利","s":"The government warned shops against ______ after the typhoon, because some had doubled the price of water.","zh":"颱風過後政府警告商店不得牟取暴利，因為有些商店把水價提高了一倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"牟取暴利","a":["profiteering"]},{"w":"self-made","pos":"adj.","def":"rich or successful through your own work","cn":"白手起家的","s":"The ______ millionaire grew up poor, but he started selling snacks at fifteen and never stopped working.","zh":"這位白手起家的百萬富翁在貧困中長大，但他十五歲就開始賣零食而且從不停歇。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"白手起家的","a":["self-made"]},{"w":"well-paid","pos":"adj.","def":"earning a lot of money","cn":"高薪的","s":"Engineering jobs in Taiwan are usually ______, so many students choose to study science at university.","zh":"工程類工作通常高薪，所以許多學生在大學選擇讀理科。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"高薪","a":["well-paid"]},{"w":"workaholic","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works too much and finds it hard to stop","cn":"工作狂","s":"My uncle is a ______ who checks emails even on holiday, so his family has asked him to switch off his phone.","zh":"我叔叔是個連度假都在收信的工作狂，所以他的家人要求他關掉手機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"工作狂","a":["workaholic"]},{"w":"lifeline","pos":"n.","def":"something that helps you survive a difficult time","cn":"救命索；命脈","s":"Online orders were a ______ for small restaurants during the lockdown, because customers could not eat inside.","zh":"封城期間線上訂單是小餐廳的救命索，因為顧客無法內用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"救命索","a":["lifeline"]},{"w":"shortcut","pos":"n.","def":"a quicker way of doing something","cn":"捷徑","s":"There is no ______ to building a good brand, so companies must keep their promises for many years.","zh":"建立好品牌沒有捷徑，所以公司必須多年來信守承諾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"捷徑","a":["shortcut"]},{"w":"track record","pos":"n.phr.","def":"past achievements that show how good someone is","cn":"過往紀錄；績效","s":"The manager has a strong ______ ______ of saving failing shops, so the owners hired her immediately.","zh":"這位經理有挽救經營不善店家的出色過往紀錄，所以老闆們立刻聘請了她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"過往紀錄","a":["track","record"]},{"w":"upstart","pos":"n.","def":"a new and confident company that challenges older ones","cn":"新貴；後起之秀","s":"The ______ airline offered cheap flights to Japan, and the older airlines quickly lowered their prices too.","zh":"這家新貴航空推出飛日本的便宜航班，而老牌航空公司也很快降低了價格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"新貴","a":["upstart"]},{"w":"knock-off","pos":"n.","def":"a cheap copy of a famous product","cn":"仿冒品","s":"The bag looked like a famous brand, but it was a ______, so the zip broke after only a week.","zh":"這個包包看起來像名牌，但它是仿冒品，所以拉鍊才一週就壞了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"仿冒品","a":["knock-off"]},{"w":"rip-off","pos":"n.","def":"something that costs far too much","cn":"敲竹槓；坑人的東西","s":"Ten dollars for a bottle of water is a ______, so we waited and bought one at a convenience store.","zh":"一瓶水要十美元根本是敲竹槓，所以我們等到便利商店才買。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"敲竹槓","a":["rip-off"]},{"w":"break even","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to earn just enough to cover costs, with no profit or loss","cn":"損益兩平","s":"The new café lost money for six months, but it finally ______ ______ in the summer, so the owner felt hopeful.","zh":"這家新咖啡店虧了六個月的錢，但終於在夏天達到損益兩平，所以老闆覺得很有希望。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"損益兩平","a":["broke","even"]},{"w":"cut costs","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to reduce the money a business spends","cn":"削減成本","s":"The factory had to ______ ______ after sales fell, so it turned off machines at night and used less packaging.","zh":"銷售下滑後工廠必須削減成本，所以它晚上關掉機器並減少包裝。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"削減成本","a":["cut","costs"]},{"w":"the bottom line","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the most important fact; or the final profit","cn":"底線；最重要的事","s":"We can discuss colours all day, but ______ ______ ______ is that customers will not pay more than five hundred dollars.","zh":"我們可以整天討論顏色，但最重要的是顧客不會付超過五百元。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"最重要的是","a":["the","bottom","line"]},{"w":"go out of business","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to stop trading because a company has failed","cn":"倒閉；歇業","s":"Many video shops ______ ______ ______ ______ when streaming became popular, and their buildings became cafés.","zh":"串流普及後許多錄影帶店倒閉了，而它們的店面變成了咖啡店。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"倒閉","a":["went","out","of","business"]},{"w":"set up shop","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start a business in a place","cn":"開店；開業","s":"The young chef decided to ______ ______ ______ in her hometown, because rent was cheaper than in Taipei.","zh":"這位年輕主廚決定在她的家鄉開店，因為租金比台北便宜。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"開店","a":["set","up","shop"]},{"w":"corner the market","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to control most of the sales of a product","cn":"壟斷市場","s":"The company tried to ______ ______ ______ in smart watches, but cheaper rivals soon appeared from abroad.","zh":"這家公司試圖在智慧手錶領域壟斷市場，但較便宜的對手很快就從國外出現。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"壟斷市場","a":["corner","the","market"]},{"w":"get off the ground","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start successfully","cn":"順利起步","s":"The project never ______ ______ ______ ______, because the team could not find enough money to build the first model.","zh":"這個計畫始終沒能順利起步，因為團隊找不到足夠的錢來製作第一個模型。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"順利起步","a":["got","off","the","ground"]},{"w":"a win-win situation","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a result that is good for everyone involved","cn":"雙贏局面","s":"The farmers sell fresh fruit to the school, and students eat healthy snacks, so it is ______ ______ ______.","zh":"農民把新鮮水果賣給學校，而學生吃到健康點心，所以這是一個雙贏局面。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"雙贏局面","a":["a","win-win","situation"]},{"w":"back to square one","pos":"phr.","def":"back to the beginning after failing","cn":"回到原點","s":"The investor pulled out at the last minute, so the founders were ______ ______ ______ ______ and had to start searching again.","zh":"投資人在最後一刻退出，所以創辦人們回到原點，必須重新開始尋找。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"回到原點","a":["back","to","square","one"]},{"w":"a ballpark figure","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a rough estimate of a number","cn":"大概的數字","s":"I know you cannot give an exact price yet, but can you give me ______ ______ ______ so I can plan my budget?","zh":"我知道你還不能給確切的價格，但你可以給我一個大概的數字讓我規劃預算嗎？","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"大概的數字","a":["a","ballpark","figure"]},{"w":"in the red","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"owing money or losing money","cn":"虧損；赤字","s":"The bookshop has been ______ ______ ______ for two years, but the owner keeps it open because she loves it.","zh":"這家書店已經虧損兩年了，但老闆因為熱愛它而繼續營業。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"虧損","a":["in","the","red"]},{"w":"in the black","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"making a profit; not in debt","cn":"有盈餘；獲利","s":"After many difficult years, the airline is finally ______ ______ ______, so it can pay back the government loan.","zh":"經過多年的艱困期，這家航空公司終於有盈餘了，所以它可以償還政府的貸款。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"有盈餘","a":["in","the","black"]},{"w":"on a shoestring","pos":"phr.","def":"with very little money","cn":"以極少的資金","s":"They started the company ______ ______ ______, working in a tiny room and using their own old laptops.","zh":"他們以極少的資金創立了公司，在一間小房間工作並使用自己的舊筆電。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"以極少的資金","a":["on","a","shoestring"]},{"w":"make a killing","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make a lot of money quickly","cn":"大賺一筆","s":"Umbrella sellers ______ ______ ______ during the sudden storm, because hundreds of tourists had not brought one.","zh":"突如其來的暴風雨期間賣傘的小販大賺一筆，因為數百名遊客沒有帶傘。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"大賺一筆","a":["made","a","killing"]},{"w":"the customer is always right","pos":"phr.","def":"a rule that shops should try to satisfy customers","cn":"顧客永遠是對的","s":"The owner believes that ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but she will not let anyone be rude to her staff.","zh":"老闆相信顧客永遠是對的，但她不會讓任何人對她的員工無禮。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"顧客永遠是對的","a":["the","customer","is","always","right"]},{"w":"climb the corporate ladder","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to move up to higher positions in a company","cn":"在公司裡步步高升","s":"He worked long hours to ______ ______ ______ ______, but later he realised he wanted more time with his children.","zh":"他長時間工作以在公司裡步步高升，但後來他意識到自己想多陪陪孩子。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"在公司裡步步高升","a":["climb","the","corporate","ladder"]},{"w":"get down to business","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start dealing with the important matter","cn":"言歸正傳；開始辦正事","s":"After a few minutes of small talk, the manager said, \"Let's ______ ______ ______ ______,\" and she opened the sales report.","zh":"閒聊幾分鐘後，經理說：「我們言歸正傳吧。」然後她打開了銷售報告。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"言歸正傳","a":["get","down","to","business"]},{"w":"seal the deal","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to finally make an agreement certain","cn":"拍板成交","s":"The two companies had talked for months, and they finally ______ ______ ______ over dinner in Tokyo.","zh":"兩家公司談了好幾個月，最後在東京的晚餐上拍板成交。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"拍板成交","a":["sealed","the","deal"]},{"w":"time is money","pos":"phr.","def":"wasting time means wasting money","cn":"時間就是金錢","s":"The delivery company believes that ______ ______ ______, so its drivers use apps to find the fastest routes.","zh":"這家快遞公司相信時間就是金錢，所以司機們用應用程式尋找最快的路線。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"時間就是金錢","a":["time","is","money"]},{"w":"take the plunge","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to decide to do something risky after thinking about it","cn":"毅然決然；放手一搏","s":"After years of dreaming, my aunt finally ______ ______ ______ and quit her office job to open a bakery.","zh":"夢想多年之後，我阿姨終於放手一搏，辭掉辦公室工作開了一家麵包店。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"放手一搏","a":["took","the","plunge"]}]};
